window.LORE_DATA = {"meta":{"game":"genshin","world":"Teyvat","title":"Irminsul Records","kicker":"Genshin Impact lore timeline","intro":"Every version of the journey from the first step in Mondstadt to the snows of Snezhnaya, with the people met along the way and what they say about each other.","current":"7.2","charWord":"Characters"},"arcs":[{"id":"mondstadt-liyue","name":"Mondstadt & Liyue","chapter":"Prologue and Chapter I","range":"1.0 to 1.6","hue":"#6fd3b4","blurb":"The City of Freedom and the Harbor of Contracts. A dragon is freed, a god stages his own funeral, and the Traveler learns that the Fatui are collecting the Gnoses of the Seven.","versions":[{"v":"1.0","name":"Welcome to Teyvat","date":"Sep 28, 2020","acts":"Prologue Acts I to III, Chapter I Acts I to II","tags":["Mondstadt","Liyue"],"text":"Separated from their twin by an unknown god, the Traveler wakes in Teyvat and meets Paimon. In Mondstadt they help the Knights of Favonius free the dragon Dvalin from the Abyss Order, only for the Fatui Harbinger Signora to steal Venti's Gnosis. In Liyue, Rex Lapis falls dead at the Rite of Descension and the Traveler is pulled into the hunt for his killer.","chars":["diluc","jean","keqing","klee","mona","qiqi","traveler","venti","amber","barbara","beidou","bennett","chongyun","fischl","kaeya","lisa","ningguang","noelle","razor","sucrose","xiangling","xingqiu"]},{"v":"1.1","name":"A New Star Approaches","date":"Nov 11, 2020","acts":"Chapter I Act III","tags":["Osial","Jade Chamber"],"text":"Childe unleashes the sea god Osial on Liyue Harbor. Adepti and the Qixing fight side by side, and Ningguang sacrifices the Jade Chamber to seal it. Zhongli is revealed as Rex Lapis himself, who staged his death and handed his Gnosis to the Tsaritsa under a contract.","chars":["tartaglia","zhongli","diona","xinyan"]},{"v":"1.2","name":"The Chalk Prince and the Dragon","date":"Dec 23, 2020","acts":"Event story","tags":["Dragonspine"],"text":"Dragonspine opens. Albedo studies the Traveler on the frozen mountain where the dragon Durin fell, and hints at his own origin as a creation of the alchemist Rhinedottir.","chars":["albedo","ganyu"]},{"v":"1.3","name":"All That Glitters","date":"Feb 3, 2021","acts":"Lantern Rite","tags":["Lantern Rite"],"text":"Liyue holds its first Lantern Rite without its god. Xiao, the last of the yakshas, keeps his lonely watch over the harbor while its people release lanterns for fallen heroes.","chars":["hu_tao","xiao"]},{"v":"1.4","name":"Invitation of Windblume","date":"Mar 17, 2021","acts":"Chapter I Act IV","tags":["Windblume","Abyss Order"],"text":"Mondstadt celebrates the Windblume Festival. In the Archon Quest the Traveler meets Dainsleif, the Bough Keeper, and finally finds their twin, who now leads the Abyss Order.","chars":["rosaria"]},{"v":"1.5","name":"Beneath the Light of Jadeite","date":"Apr 28, 2021","acts":"Story quests","tags":["Azhdaha","Serenitea Pot"],"text":"Zhongli faces Azhdaha, the dragon he once befriended and later sealed when erosion took its mind. Eula of the disgraced Lawrence clan and the legal adviser Yanfei arrive.","chars":["eula","yanfei"]},{"v":"1.6","name":"Midsummer Island Adventure","date":"Jun 9, 2021","acts":"Chapter II Prologue","tags":["Golden Apple Archipelago"],"text":"Klee leads a summer trip to the Golden Apple Archipelago. Back in Liyue, the wandering samurai Kazuha tells of Inazuma's Vision Hunt Decree, and Beidou agrees to carry the Traveler across the storm.","chars":["kaedehara_kazuha"]}]},{"id":"inazuma","name":"Inazuma","chapter":"Chapter II","range":"2.0 to 2.8","hue":"#b48cf2","blurb":"The Nation of Eternity, sealed behind thunderstorms. The Raiden Shogun seizes Visions to freeze her country in place, and a resistance rises against her.","versions":[{"v":"2.0","name":"The Immovable God and the Eternal Euthymia","date":"Jul 21, 2021","acts":"Chapter II Acts I to II","tags":["Vision Hunt Decree"],"text":"Inazuma is locked down by the Sakoku Decree, and the Raiden Shogun confiscates Visions in the name of eternity. The Traveler slips ashore with Thoma's help, allies with Kamisato Ayaka and Yoimiya, and escapes the Shogun's blade to join the resistance.","chars":["kamisato_ayaka","yoimiya","sayu"]},{"v":"2.1","name":"Floating World Under the Moonlight","date":"Sep 1, 2021","acts":"Chapter II Act III","tags":["Watatsumi","Signora"],"text":"With Kokomi's resistance the Traveler uncovers the Fatui plot behind the Decree. Signora is executed after a duel before the throne, and the Traveler confronts Ei inside the Plane of Euthymia. The Vision Hunt ends.","chars":["aloy","raiden_shogun","sangonomiya_kokomi","kujou_sara"]},{"v":"2.2","name":"Into the Perilous Labyrinth of Fog","date":"Oct 13, 2021","acts":"World quests","tags":["Tsurumi Island"],"text":"Tsurumi Island opens, a place lost in fog and trapped in a single repeating day. Thoma, the Kamisato housekeeper, becomes playable.","chars":["thoma"]},{"v":"2.3","name":"Shadows Amidst Snowstorms","date":"Nov 24, 2021","acts":"Event story","tags":["Dragonspine"],"text":"An impostor wearing Albedo's face stalks Dragonspine, and the real Albedo asks the Traveler to end him if he ever loses control. Arataki Itto and Gorou debut.","chars":["arataki_itto","gorou"]},{"v":"2.4","name":"Fleeting Colors in Flight","date":"Jan 5, 2022","acts":"Interlude Act I","tags":["Enkanomiya","Lantern Rite"],"text":"Enkanomiya, the sunless realm beneath Watatsumi, opens. In Liyue, Ningguang rebuilds the Jade Chamber, and Shenhe helps defend it from Beisht, Osial's vengeful consort.","chars":["shenhe","yun_jin"]},{"v":"2.5","name":"When the Sakura Bloom","date":"Feb 16, 2022","acts":"Story quests","tags":["Yae Miko"],"text":"Yae Miko pushes Ei into a final reckoning with the Shogun puppet over what eternity should mean. Ei wins, and chooses an eternity that can change.","chars":["yae_miko"]},{"v":"2.6","name":"Zephyr of the Violet Garden","date":"Mar 30, 2022","acts":"Chapter II Act IV","tags":["The Chasm","Irodori Festival"],"text":"The Chasm opens. With Dainsleif, the Traveler learns of the curse on Khaenri'ah's people and the Abyss Order's plan for a Loom of Fate. Kamisato Ayato steps out of the shadows.","chars":["kamisato_ayato"]},{"v":"2.7","name":"Hidden Dreams in the Depths","date":"May 31, 2022","acts":"Interlude Act II","tags":["The Chasm"],"text":"Trapped beneath the Chasm with Yelan, Xiao, Itto, Shinobu and Yanfei, the Traveler learns the fate of the yaksha Bosacius, and Xiao is saved by the god he serves.","chars":["yelan","kuki_shinobu"]},{"v":"2.8","name":"Summer Fantasia","date":"Jul 13, 2022","acts":"Event story","tags":["Golden Apple Archipelago"],"text":"The Golden Apple Archipelago returns, reshaped into illusions drawn from the hearts of Kazuha, Xinyan, Fischl and Mona. Detective Shikanoin Heizou debuts.","chars":["shikanoin_heizou"]}]},{"id":"sumeru","name":"Sumeru","chapter":"Chapter III","range":"3.0 to 3.8","hue":"#9bd45c","blurb":"The Nation of Wisdom, split between rainforest and desert. The Akademiya's sages cage their own archon and try to build a god of their own.","versions":[{"v":"3.0","name":"The Morn a Thousand Roses Brings","date":"Aug 24, 2022","acts":"Chapter III Acts I to II","tags":["Dendro","Rainforest"],"text":"Sumeru opens with the Dendro element. The Akademiya rules through the Akasha Terminal and keeps the young archon Nahida confined. During the Sabzeruz Festival the Traveler is caught in a looping day, a samsara built to harvest the dreams of the city.","chars":["tighnari","collei","dori"]},{"v":"3.1","name":"King Deshret and the Three Magi","date":"Sep 28, 2022","acts":"Chapter III Acts III to IV","tags":["Desert"],"text":"The desert opens. The Traveler learns the sages are building a new god with Fatui help, then gathers Alhaitham, Cyno, Dehya and Candace to plan Nahida's rescue.","chars":["cyno","nilou","candace"]},{"v":"3.2","name":"Akasha Pulses, the Kalpa Flame Rises","date":"Nov 2, 2022","acts":"Chapter III Act V","tags":["Irminsul","Scaramouche"],"text":"Nahida is freed. The Traveler defeats Scaramouche in his god-machine, and Nahida erases Greater Lord Rukkhadevata from Irminsul to cure the world of forbidden knowledge. Dottore leaves with two Gnoses.","chars":["nahida","layla"]},{"v":"3.3","name":"All Senses Clear, All Existence Void","date":"Dec 7, 2022","acts":"Interlude Act III","tags":["Irminsul"],"text":"Scaramouche tries to delete himself from history inside Irminsul. The world forgets him, yet he survives as the Wanderer and chooses to take his memories back.","chars":["wanderer","faruzan"]},{"v":"3.4","name":"The Exquisite Night Chimes","date":"Jan 18, 2023","acts":"Lantern Rite","tags":["Desert of Hadramaveth"],"text":"The Desert of Hadramaveth opens and Lantern Rite returns to Liyue. Alhaitham and the little adeptus disciple Yaoyao debut.","chars":["alhaitham","yaoyao"]},{"v":"3.5","name":"Windblume's Breath","date":"Mar 1, 2023","acts":"Chapter III Act VI","tags":["Caribert"],"text":"Through the memories of Kaeya's ancestor, the Traveler sees how their twin and Chlothar Alberich came to found the Abyss Order. Dehya and Mika debut.","chars":["dehya","mika"]},{"v":"3.6","name":"A Parade of Providence","date":"Apr 12, 2023","acts":"Story quests","tags":["Girdle of the Sands"],"text":"The Akademiya holds its Interdarshan Championship, and Nahida's second story returns to the wound in Irminsul. Baizhu and Kaveh debut.","chars":["baizhu","kaveh"]},{"v":"3.7","name":"Duel! The Summoners' Summit!","date":"May 24, 2023","acts":"Event story","tags":["Genius Invokation"],"text":"A Genius Invokation TCG tournament draws card players from every nation. Kirara, the nekomata courier, debuts.","chars":["kirara"]},{"v":"3.8","name":"Secret Summer Paradise","date":"Jul 5, 2023","acts":"Event story","tags":["Veluriyam Mirage"],"text":"Klee, Eula, Collei and Kaeya explore the Veluriyam Mirage, a world in a bottle kept by the Oceanid Idyia.","chars":[]}]},{"id":"fontaine","name":"Fontaine","chapter":"Chapter IV","range":"4.0 to 4.8","hue":"#58b6f0","blurb":"The Nation of Justice, where trials are theatre. A prophecy says its people will dissolve into the sea and leave their archon weeping alone on her throne.","versions":[{"v":"4.0","name":"As Light Rain Falls Without Reason","date":"Aug 16, 2023","acts":"Chapter IV Acts I to II","tags":["Opera Epiclese"],"text":"Fontaine opens. The magician Lyney is tried at the Opera Epiclese for a vanishing during his show, and the Traveler exposes the real culprit behind years of serial disappearances.","chars":["lyney","freminet","lynette"]},{"v":"4.1","name":"To the Stars Shining in the Depths","date":"Sep 27, 2023","acts":"Chapter IV Acts III to IV","tags":["Fortress of Meropide"],"text":"In the undersea Fortress of Meropide, Duke Wriothesley holds back the rising Primordial Sea. Childe is convicted by the Oratrice without cause, and Neuvillette's nature as the Hydro Dragon comes into view.","chars":["neuvillette","wriothesley"]},{"v":"4.2","name":"Masquerade of the Guilty","date":"Nov 8, 2023","acts":"Chapter IV Act V","tags":["Prophecy"],"text":"Furina is put on trial. She is the human half of the archon Focalors, who played a god for five hundred years so that Focalors could return the Hydro authority to Neuvillette and break the prophecy. The flood comes, and Fontaine survives it.","chars":["furina","charlotte"]},{"v":"4.3","name":"Roses and Muskets","date":"Dec 20, 2023","acts":"Story quests","tags":["Spina di Rosula"],"text":"Navia lays her father's case to rest and takes the Spina di Rosula forward. Captain Chevreuse of the Special Security and Surveillance Patrol debuts.","chars":["navia","chevreuse"]},{"v":"4.4","name":"Vibrant Harriers Aloft in Spring Breeze","date":"Jan 31, 2024","acts":"Lantern Rite","tags":["Chenyu Vale"],"text":"Chenyu Vale opens between Liyue and Fontaine. Cloud Retainer walks among mortals as Xianyun, and the lion dancer Gaming chases his dream during Lantern Rite.","chars":["xianyun","gaming"]},{"v":"4.5","name":"Blades Weaving Betwixt Brocade","date":"Mar 13, 2024","acts":"Story quests","tags":["Chioriya Boutique"],"text":"Chiori, an Inazuman designer who built her boutique in the Court of Fontaine, debuts with a story from her shop floor.","chars":["chiori"]},{"v":"4.6","name":"Two Worlds Aflame, the Crimson Night Fades","date":"Apr 24, 2024","acts":"Story quests","tags":["Remuria","House of the Hearth"],"text":"Arlecchino's story opens the House of the Hearth and the curse of the Crimson Moon. Below the waves, the Sea of Bygone Eras reveals the fallen empire of Remuria.","chars":["arlecchino"]},{"v":"4.7","name":"An Everlasting Dream Intertwined","date":"Jun 5, 2024","acts":"Chapter IV Act VI","tags":["Bedtime Story"],"text":"With Dainsleif, the Traveler meets their twin face to face and learns of the Sinner Vedrfolnir behind the Abyss Order. Clorinde, Sigewinne and Sethos debut.","chars":["clorinde","sigewinne","sethos"]},{"v":"4.8","name":"Summertide Scales and Tales","date":"Jul 17, 2024","acts":"Event story","tags":["Simulanka"],"text":"A storybook world of paper and toys called Simulanka, written by the witches of the Hexenzirkel, needs heroes to save it from its own dragon. Emilie debuts.","chars":["emilie"]}]},{"id":"natlan","name":"Natlan","chapter":"Chapter V","range":"5.0 to 5.8","hue":"#f08a4b","blurb":"The Nation of War, land of dragons and the Sacred Flame. Six tribes fight a war against the Abyss that has never ended, led by a human archon.","versions":[{"v":"5.0","name":"Flowers Resplendent on the Sun-Scorched Sojourn","date":"Aug 28, 2024","acts":"Chapter V Acts I to II","tags":["Saurians","Night Kingdom"],"text":"Natlan opens. Its tribes compete in the Pilgrimage of the Return of the Sacred Flame to choose warriors for the Night Warden Wars. When Kachina is lost in the Night Kingdom, the Traveler brings her back and earns an Ancient Name of their own.","chars":["kinich","mualani","kachina"]},{"v":"5.1","name":"The Rainbow Destined to Burn","date":"Oct 9, 2024","acts":"Chapter V Acts III to IV","tags":["Six Heroes"],"text":"Mavuika reveals she is a human who slept five hundred years to finish the plan against the Abyss. She gathers six heroes, and Capitano, First of the Harbingers, becomes an uneasy ally as the Abyss breaks through.","chars":["xilonen"]},{"v":"5.2","name":"Tapestry of Spirit and Flame","date":"Nov 20, 2024","acts":"Tribal chronicles","tags":["Flower-Feather Clan","Night-Wind"],"text":"Two more tribes open, the Flower-Feather Clan and the Masters of the Night-Wind. Chasca and Ororon debut.","chars":["chasca","ororon"]},{"v":"5.3","name":"Incandescent Ode of Resurrection","date":"Jan 1, 2025","acts":"Chapter V Act V","tags":["Lord of the Night"],"text":"All of Natlan fights the last war. Mavuika destroys the Abyss's vessel, and Capitano takes the throne of the Lord of the Night so that the dead can rest and Mavuika can live. Citlali debuts.","chars":["citlali","mavuika","lan_yan"]},{"v":"5.4","name":"Moonlight Amidst Dreams","date":"Feb 12, 2025","acts":"Event story","tags":["Mikawa Flower Festival"],"text":"Inazuma's yokai hold the Mikawa Flower Festival. Yumemizuki Mizuki, a baku who eats nightmares, debuts.","chars":["yumemizuki_mizuki"]},{"v":"5.5","name":"Day of the Flame's Return","date":"Mar 26, 2025","acts":"Chapter V Interlude","tags":["Collective of Plenty","Sacred Mountain"],"text":"The Collective of Plenty and the great volcano open. Natlan rebuilds after the war, and Varesa and Iansan debut.","chars":["varesa","iansan"]},{"v":"5.6","name":"Paralogism","date":"May 7, 2025","acts":"Interlude Act IV","tags":["Mondstadt"],"text":"An interlude in Mondstadt centred on Albedo, where an elaborate deception tests what the Traveler can trust. Escoffier, once head chef of the Hotel Debord, and Ifa debut.","chars":["escoffier","ifa"]},{"v":"5.7","name":"Battle of Imagined Arrays","date":"Jun 18, 2025","acts":"Chapter V Act VI","tags":["Skirk","Dainsleif"],"text":"Skirk, Childe's master, arrives from the Abyss. With her and Dainsleif the Traveler goes after what was lost from their own past. Dahlia debuts.","chars":["skirk","dahlia"]},{"v":"5.8","name":"Sunspray Summer Resort","date":"Jul 30, 2025","acts":"Event story","tags":["Easybreeze Holiday Resort"],"text":"A summer festival at a resort in Natlan. Ineffa, a robot built in Nod-Krai, arrives ahead of the next chapter.","chars":["ineffa"]}]},{"id":"nod-krai","name":"Nod-Krai","chapter":"Song of the Welkin Moon","range":"6.0 to 6.7","hue":"#9fb7ff","blurb":"A lawless frontier south of Snezhnaya where three moons once hung. The Frostmoon Scions, the Lightkeepers and the Fatui all reach for the power of the moon.","versions":[{"v":"6.0","name":"A Dance of Snowy Tides and Hoarfrost Groves","tag":"Luna I","date":"Sep 10, 2025","acts":"Welkin Moon Acts I to II","tags":["Kuuvahki","Wild Hunt"],"text":"Nod-Krai opens. The Traveler meets Lauma of the Frostmoon Scions, the Lightkeeper Flins and the inventor Aino while the Wild Hunt stirs and the Fatui move to seize the power of the Moon Maiden.","chars":["flins","lauma","aino"]},{"v":"6.1","name":"An Elegy for Faded Moonlight","tag":"Luna II","date":"Oct 22, 2025","acts":"Welkin Moon Acts III to IV","tags":["Nasha Town"],"text":"The story moves into Nasha Town's underworld and the Curatorium of Secrets, where Nefer trades in information, and toward a nation that does not exist.","chars":["nefer"]},{"v":"6.2","name":"A Nocturne of the Far North","tag":"Luna III","date":"Dec 3, 2025","acts":"Welkin Moon Acts V to VI","tags":["Moon-Prayer Night"],"text":"Columbina, the Moon Maiden, searches the past for her true name. On Moon-Prayer Night she prepares for the journey home. Durin, a dragon reborn from a storybook, and Jahoda debut.","chars":["durin","jahoda"]},{"v":"6.3","name":"A Traveler on a Winter's Night","tag":"Luna IV","date":"Jan 14, 2026","acts":"Welkin Moon Acts VII to VIII","tags":["True Moon","Lantern Rite"],"text":"A battle for Nod-Krai begins on a moonless night. The Doctor's scheme closes in step by step, until the Welkin Moon returns to its homeland. Columbina, Zibai and Illuga debut.","chars":["columbina","zibai","illuga"]},{"v":"6.4","name":"Homeward, He Who Caught the Wind","tag":"Luna V","date":"Feb 25, 2026","acts":"Story quests","tags":["Knights of Favonius"],"text":"Grand Master Varka, absent since before the Traveler arrived, finally leads his expedition home to Mondstadt and becomes playable.","chars":["varka"]},{"v":"6.5","name":"Rondo: Augured Homecoming","tag":"Luna VI","date":"Apr 8, 2026","acts":"Event story","tags":["Northern Mondstadt"],"text":"Mondstadt's map grows northward. Linnea, a naturalist who advises the Nod-Krai branch of the Adventurers' Guild, debuts.","chars":["linnea"]},{"v":"6.6","name":"As All Falls to Emptiness","tag":"Luna VII","date":"May 20, 2026","acts":"Welkin Moon Acts IX to X","tags":["Irminsul","Hexenzirkel"],"text":"Irminsul falters and Nahida falls into a coma. The Traveler regroups at Caravan Ribat and the Temple of Silence as Sumeru braces for a war beyond ordinary people. Nicole of the Hexenzirkel, Lohen and Prune debut.","chars":["lohen","nicole","prune"]},{"v":"6.7","name":"Sunny Summer Fontinalia","tag":"Luna VIII","date":"Jul 1, 2026","acts":"Event story","tags":["Fontaine"],"text":"A summer festival in Fontaine. Sandrone, the Harbinger known as Marionette, becomes playable.","chars":["sandrone"]}]},{"id":"snezhnaya","name":"Snezhnaya","chapter":"Chapter VII","range":"7.0 to 7.2","hue":"#bfe6ff","blurb":"The Tsaritsa's nation of everwinter and the homeland of the Fatui. After six years of meeting its agents abroad, the Traveler finally walks its snow.","versions":[{"v":"7.0","name":"Everwinter Without Mercy","date":"Aug 12, 2026","acts":"Chapter VII Acts I to II","tags":["Snezhnaya opens"],"text":"Snezhnaya opens. A catastrophic blizzard and an energy crisis grip the country, and the first acts show what the Fatui have been fighting at home and why their methods grew so extreme. Odette and Alyosha debut.","chars":["odette","alyosha"]},{"v":"7.1","name":"A Rekviem for the Underworld","date":"Sep 23, 2026","acts":"Chapter VII continues","tags":["Sixth anniversary","Ronova"],"text":"The Snezhnaya chapter continues, and Ronova, the Ruler of Death, appears as a weekly boss. Vesna, commander of the Tsaritsa's Druzhna, and the prima donna Vodyanitsa debut.","chars":["vesna","vodyanitsa"]},{"v":"7.2","name":"Hour of Ruin","date":"Nov 4, 2026","acts":"Chapter VII continues","tags":["Eastern Snezhnaya"],"text":"The Nails of Retribution grow unstable, pillars of light rise and Holy Soil spreads, a danger to all seven nations. Two areas open in eastern Snezhnaya. Mitya and Valeriy debut.","chars":["mitya","valeriy"]}]}],"chars":[{"id":"aino","name":"Aino","title":"Clinky-Clank Gadgets-A-Gogo","el":"Hydro","weapon":"Claymore","rarity":4,"region":"Nod-Krai","faction":"Clink-Clank Krumkake Craftshop","birthday":"September 21","extra":"Cistellula Mira","ver":"6.0","lore":"A child prodigy mechanic of Nod-Krai whose gadgets brighten a cold frontier. Ineffa is her creation and her family.","art":true},{"id":"albedo","name":"Albedo","title":"Kreideprinz","el":"Geo","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Knights of Favonius","birthday":"September 13","extra":"Princeps Cretaceus","ver":"1.2","lore":"Chief Alchemist of the Knights, a synthetic human made by Rhinedottir of Khaenri'ah. He fears what he may become and asks friends to stop him if it happens.","art":true},{"id":"alhaitham","name":"Alhaitham","title":"Admonishing Instruction","el":"Dendro","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Sumeru","faction":"Sumeru Akademiya","birthday":"February 11","extra":"Vultur Volans","ver":"3.4","lore":"Scribe of the Akademiya, a rationalist who wants a quiet life and overthrew the sages mostly to get it back.","art":true},{"id":"aloy","name":"Aloy","title":"Savior From Another World","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Bow","rarity":5,"region":"Beyond","faction":"Wandering Heroine","birthday":"April 4","extra":"Nora Fortis","ver":"2.1","lore":"A hunter from another world entirely, carried to Teyvat by a crossover.","art":true},{"id":"alyosha","name":"Alyosha","title":"Swift-Striding Hound","el":"Electro","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":4,"region":"Snezhnaya","faction":"Snezhnaya","birthday":"February 9","extra":"Canis Borzoides","ver":"7.0","lore":"A professional hunter who knows the Snezhnayan snowfields better than anyone. A fierce idealism burns under his calm.","art":true},{"id":"amber","name":"Amber","title":"Gliding Champion","el":"Pyro","weapon":"Bow","rarity":4,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Knights of Favonius","birthday":"August 10","extra":"Lepus","ver":"1.0","lore":"The only Outrider left in the Knights of Favonius and the first friend the Traveler makes in Mondstadt. She inherited her post, and her optimism, from her grandfather.","art":true},{"id":"arataki_itto","name":"Arataki Itto","title":"Hanamizaka Heroics","el":"Geo","weapon":"Claymore","rarity":5,"region":"Inazuma","faction":"Arataki Gang","birthday":"June 1","extra":"Taurus Iracundus","ver":"2.3","lore":"The loud and proud oni leader of the Arataki Gang, forever challenging Kujou Sara to a rematch for the Vision she took from him.","art":true},{"id":"arlecchino","name":"Arlecchino","title":"Dire Balemoon","el":"Pyro","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":5,"region":"Snezhnaya","faction":"Fatui","birthday":"August 22","extra":"Ignis Purgatorius","ver":"4.6","lore":"The Knave, Fourth of the Fatui Harbingers and Father of the House of the Hearth. She killed the last Mother, ended its cruelty, and bears the curse of the Crimson Moon.","art":true},{"id":"baizhu","name":"Baizhu","title":"Beyond Mortality","el":"Dendro","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":5,"region":"Liyue","faction":"Bubu Pharmacy","birthday":"April 25","extra":"Lagenaria","ver":"3.6","lore":"Owner of Bubu Pharmacy. He inherited a contract with the snake Changsheng that lets him take illness into his own body.","art":true},{"id":"barbara","name":"Barbara","title":"Shining Idol","el":"Hydro","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":4,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Church of Favonius","birthday":"July 5","extra":"Crater","ver":"1.0","lore":"Deaconess of the Church of Favonius and Mondstadt's beloved idol. She is Jean's younger sister, raised apart after their parents separated.","art":true},{"id":"beidou","name":"Beidou","title":"Uncrowned Lord of the Ocean","el":"Electro","weapon":"Claymore","rarity":4,"region":"Liyue","faction":"The Crux","birthday":"February 14","extra":"Victor Mare","ver":"1.0","lore":"Captain of the Crux Fleet, who killed the sea monster Haishan without a Vision. She ferries the Traveler to Inazuma in defiance of the Sakoku Decree.","art":true},{"id":"bennett","name":"Bennett","title":"Trial by Fire","el":"Pyro","weapon":"Sword","rarity":4,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Adventurers' Guild","birthday":"February 29","extra":"Rota Calamitas","ver":"1.0","lore":"The unluckiest adventurer in Mondstadt, found as a baby by an old explorer and raised by the Guild. He leads Benny's Adventure Team, usually alone.","art":true},{"id":"candace","name":"Candace","title":"Golden Vow","el":"Hydro","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":4,"region":"Sumeru","faction":"Aaru Village","birthday":"May 3","extra":"Sagitta Scutum","ver":"3.1","lore":"Guardian of Aaru Village and a descendant of King Deshret. She shelters scholars exiled by the Akademiya.","art":true},{"id":"charlotte","name":"Charlotte","title":"Lens of Verity","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":4,"region":"Fontaine","faction":"The Steambird","birthday":"April 10","extra":"Hualina Veritas","ver":"4.2","lore":"A reporter for The Steambird who will chase the truth into any danger with her Kamera, Monsieur Verite.","art":true},{"id":"chasca","name":"Chasca","title":"Skyborne Arbiter","el":"Anemo","weapon":"Bow","rarity":5,"region":"Natlan","faction":"Tlalocan","birthday":"December 10","extra":"Vultur Gryphus","ver":"5.2","lore":"A peacekeeper of the Flower-Feather Clan who was raised by Qucusaurs and learned to fly without wings.","art":true},{"id":"chevreuse","name":"Chevreuse","title":"Executor of Justice","el":"Pyro","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":4,"region":"Fontaine","faction":"Special Security and Surveillance Patrol","birthday":"January 10","extra":"Sclopetum Ensiferum","ver":"4.3","lore":"Captain of the Special Security and Surveillance Patrol, raised in the Fortress of Meropide and incapable of bending a rule.","art":true},{"id":"chiori","name":"Chiori","title":"The Thundering Seamstress","el":"Geo","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Inazuma","faction":"Court of Fontaine","birthday":"August 17","extra":"Cisoria","ver":"4.5","lore":"An Inazuman designer who owns Chioriya Boutique in Fontaine. Blunt, exacting and unwilling to flatter anyone.","art":true},{"id":"chongyun","name":"Chongyun","title":"Frozen Ardor","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Claymore","rarity":4,"region":"Liyue","faction":"Tianheng Thaumaturges","birthday":"September 7","extra":"Nubis Caesor","ver":"1.0","lore":"An exorcist born with so much yang energy that spirits flee before he can see them. He fights to keep his temper cool.","art":true},{"id":"citlali","name":"Citlali","title":"Obsidian Opalstar","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":5,"region":"Natlan","faction":"Mictlan","birthday":"January 20","extra":"Patina Anavatlaca","ver":"5.3","lore":"A two hundred year old shaman of the Masters of the Night-Wind, known as Granny Itztli, who would rather stay home with light novels.","art":true},{"id":"clorinde","name":"Clorinde","title":"Candlebearer, Shadowhunter","el":"Electro","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Fontaine","faction":"Trial Court","birthday":"September 20","extra":"Rapperia","ver":"4.7","lore":"Champion Duelist of Fontaine's court, raised by a Marechaussee hunter. Her blade ended the life of Navia's father, at his own request.","art":true},{"id":"collei","name":"Collei","title":"Sprout of Rebirth","el":"Dendro","weapon":"Bow","rarity":4,"region":"Sumeru","faction":"Gandharva Ville","birthday":"May 8","extra":"Leptailurus Cervarius","ver":"3.0","lore":"A trainee Forest Ranger and survivor of Dottore's experiments. She was freed of the archon residue in her blood and is learning to live without fear.","art":true},{"id":"columbina","name":"Columbina","title":"Welkin Moon's Homecoming","el":"Hydro","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":5,"region":"Nod-Krai","faction":"Silvermoon Hall","birthday":"January 14","extra":"???","ver":"6.3","lore":"The Moon Maiden born in Nod-Krai, once the Third Harbinger called Damselette. She is the Welkin Moon itself, trying to go home.","art":true},{"id":"cyno","name":"Cyno","title":"Judicator of Secrets","el":"Electro","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":5,"region":"Sumeru","faction":"Temple of Silence","birthday":"June 23","extra":"Lupus Aureus","ver":"3.1","lore":"The General Mahamatra, enforcer of the Akademiya's law, who carries a spirit of King Deshret's priests. He tells terrible jokes.","art":true},{"id":"dahlia","name":"Dahlia","title":"Ode and Oblation","el":"Hydro","weapon":"Sword","rarity":4,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Church of Favonius","birthday":"May 25","extra":"Cantus Choralis","ver":"5.7","lore":"Deacon of the Church of Favonius and the Anemo Archon's own representative there, charming and relaxed about doctrine.","art":true},{"id":"dehya","name":"Dehya","title":"Flame-Mane","el":"Pyro","weapon":"Claymore","rarity":5,"region":"Sumeru","faction":"The Eremites","birthday":"April 7","extra":"Mantichora","ver":"3.5","lore":"The Flame-Mane, a mercenary of the Eremites with a strict code. She guards Dunyarzad and comes to fight for Sumeru itself.","art":true},{"id":"diluc","name":"Diluc","title":"Dark Side of Dawn","el":"Pyro","weapon":"Claymore","rarity":5,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Dawn Winery","birthday":"April 30","extra":"Noctua","ver":"1.0","lore":"Owner of the Dawn Winery. He left the Knights after they covered up his father's death, and now protects the city at night as the Darknight Hero.","art":true},{"id":"diona","name":"Diona","title":"Kätzlein Cocktail","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Bow","rarity":4,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"The Cat's Tail","birthday":"January 18","extra":"Feles","ver":"1.1","lore":"The bartender of the Cat's Tail, a child of the Katzlein bloodline who hates alcohol and cannot make a bad drink no matter how she tries.","art":true},{"id":"dori","name":"Dori","title":"Treasure of Dream Garden","el":"Electro","weapon":"Claymore","rarity":4,"region":"Sumeru","faction":"The Palace of Alcazarzaray","birthday":"December 21","extra":"Magicae Lucerna","ver":"3.0","lore":"A merchant who can find anything for a price. Her greed began as a promise to someone she could not afford to save.","art":true},{"id":"durin","name":"Durin","title":"The Undying Fire","el":"Pyro","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Hexenzirkel","birthday":"March 14","extra":"Draco Rubedo","ver":"6.2","lore":"A dragon written into being by the witch M, Rhinedottir. The first Durin died on Dragonspine. This one was given a gentler story.","art":true},{"id":"emilie","name":"Emilie","title":"A Thousand Scents Traced","el":"Dendro","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":5,"region":"Fontaine","faction":"Court of Fontaine","birthday":"September 22","extra":"Pomum de Ambra","ver":"4.8","lore":"A perfumer of Fontaine who also works as a forensic cleaner, removing every trace a crime leaves behind.","art":true},{"id":"escoffier","name":"Escoffier","title":"Tasteful Excellence","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":5,"region":"Fontaine","faction":"Fontaine","birthday":"June 8","extra":"Dulciaria Structura","ver":"5.6","lore":"Once head chef of the Hotel Debord and now a free agent of Fontaine cuisine, exact to the gram.","art":true},{"id":"eula","name":"Eula","title":"Dance of the Shimmering Wave","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Claymore","rarity":5,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Knights of Favonius","birthday":"October 25","extra":"Aphros Delos","ver":"1.5","lore":"Captain of the Reconnaissance Company and a descendant of the tyrant Lawrence clan. She joined the Knights her family despises and swears vengeance she never takes.","art":true},{"id":"faruzan","name":"Faruzan","title":"Enigmatic Machinist","el":"Anemo","weapon":"Bow","rarity":4,"region":"Sumeru","faction":"Haravatat","birthday":"August 20","extra":"Flosculi Implexi","ver":"3.3","lore":"A scholar of ancient machines who was trapped in a ruin for a hundred years. She returned unchanged to an Akademiya that had forgotten her.","art":true},{"id":"fischl","name":"Fischl","title":"Prinzessin der Verurteilung!","el":"Electro","weapon":"Bow","rarity":4,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Adventurers' Guild","birthday":"May 27","extra":"Corvus","ver":"1.0","lore":"Self-styled Prinzessin der Verurteilung, an Adventurers' Guild investigator who lives inside the fantasy novels she loved. Her raven Oz is quite real.","art":true},{"id":"flins","name":"Flins","title":"Shadowy Lights, Stranger Wights","el":"Electro","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":5,"region":"Nod-Krai","faction":"Lightkeepers","birthday":"October 31","extra":"Laterna Vigilis","ver":"6.0","lore":"A courtly Lightkeeper who guards a lighthouse and a graveyard on a northern isle. He is older than he looks and not entirely human.","art":true},{"id":"freminet","name":"Freminet","title":"Yearning for Unseen Depths","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Claymore","rarity":4,"region":"Fontaine","faction":"Hotel Bouffes d'ete","birthday":"September 24","extra":"Automaton","ver":"4.0","lore":"A quiet diver of the House of the Hearth who prefers the sea floor and his clockwork penguin to people.","art":true},{"id":"furina","name":"Furina","title":"Endless Solo of Solitude","el":"Hydro","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Fontaine","faction":"Court of Fontaine","birthday":"October 13","extra":"Animula Choragi","ver":"4.2","lore":"The human made by Focalors to play Hydro Archon. She acted the part alone for five hundred years to save Fontaine, and now learns to live for herself.","art":true},{"id":"gaming","name":"Gaming","title":"Leonine Vanguard","el":"Pyro","weapon":"Claymore","rarity":4,"region":"Liyue","faction":"Sword and Strongbox Secure Transport Agency","birthday":"December 22","extra":"Leo Expergiscens","ver":"4.4","lore":"A guard for a transport agency who came to Liyue to become a wushou dancer against his father's wishes.","art":true},{"id":"ganyu","name":"Ganyu","title":"Plenilune Gaze","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Bow","rarity":5,"region":"Liyue","faction":"Yuehai Pavilion","birthday":"December 2","extra":"Sinae Unicornis","ver":"1.2","lore":"Secretary to the Liyue Qixing, half human and half qilin. She has served the harbor since signing a contract with Rex Lapis during the Archon War.","art":true},{"id":"gorou","name":"Gorou","title":"Canine Warrior","el":"Geo","weapon":"Bow","rarity":4,"region":"Inazuma","faction":"Watatsumi Island","birthday":"May 18","extra":"Canis Bellatoris","ver":"2.3","lore":"The dog-eared general of the Watatsumi army, trusted completely by his soldiers and by Kokomi.","art":true},{"id":"hu_tao","name":"Hu Tao","title":"Fragrance in Thaw","el":"Pyro","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":5,"region":"Liyue","faction":"Wangsheng Funeral Parlor","birthday":"July 15","extra":"Papilio Charontis","ver":"1.3","lore":"The 77th Director of the Wangsheng Funeral Parlor. A prankster who guards the border between life and death with complete seriousness.","art":true},{"id":"iansan","name":"Iansan","title":"Tempered in Molten Stone","el":"Electro","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":4,"region":"Natlan","faction":"Teteocan","birthday":"August 8","extra":"Carnotaurus","ver":"5.5","lore":"Natlan's strictest coach, a warrior of the Collective of Plenty and one of Mavuika's six heroes.","art":true},{"id":"ifa","name":"Ifa","title":"In the Wake of Wandering Winds","el":"Anemo","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":4,"region":"Natlan","faction":"Tlalocan","birthday":"March 23","extra":"Catena Opele","ver":"5.6","lore":"A saurian veterinarian of the Flower-Feather Clan, never seen without his Qucusaur partner Cacucu.","art":true},{"id":"illuga","name":"Illuga","title":"Nightmare's Burning Heart","el":"Geo","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":4,"region":"Nod-Krai","faction":"Lightkeepers","birthday":"December 23","extra":"Oriolus","ver":"6.3","lore":"The youngest squad leader of the Lightkeepers, who leads the Nightmare Orioles against the Wild Hunt.","art":true},{"id":"ineffa","name":"Ineffa","title":"Boom Boom Thunderwave","el":"Electro","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":5,"region":"Nod-Krai","faction":"Clink-Clank Krumkake Craftshop","birthday":"April 2","extra":"Vanilla Planifolia","ver":"5.8","lore":"A multifunctional robot assembled from the machines of many nations. She keeps house for Aino and is working out what a self is.","art":true},{"id":"jahoda","name":"Jahoda","title":"Windthreading Shadow","el":"Anemo","weapon":"Bow","rarity":4,"region":"Nod-Krai","faction":"Curatorium of Secrets","birthday":"January 5","extra":"Fragum","ver":"6.2","lore":"The Curatorium of Secrets' all-purpose employee, by her own account extremely reliable.","art":true},{"id":"jean","name":"Jean","title":"Dandelion Knight","el":"Anemo","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Knights of Favonius","birthday":"March 14","extra":"Leo Minor","ver":"1.0","lore":"Acting Grand Master of the Knights of Favonius. She holds Mondstadt together in Varka's absence and rarely allows herself a day of rest.","art":true},{"id":"kachina","name":"Kachina","title":"Mottled Gold Yet Unsmelted","el":"Geo","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":4,"region":"Natlan","faction":"Nanatzcayan","birthday":"April 22","extra":"Ochotona Princeps","ver":"5.0","lore":"A young warrior of the Children of Echoes who cries easily and gives up never. Her Ancient Name is Uthabiti.","art":true},{"id":"kaedehara_kazuha","name":"Kaedehara Kazuha","title":"Scarlet Leaves Pursue Wild Waves","el":"Anemo","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Inazuma","faction":"The Crux","birthday":"October 29","extra":"Acer Palmatum","ver":"1.6","lore":"A wandering samurai of a fallen clan. He fled Inazuma carrying the dead Vision of a friend who challenged the Shogun, and found shelter with the Crux.","art":true},{"id":"kaeya","name":"Kaeya","title":"Frostwind Swordsman","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Sword","rarity":4,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Knights of Favonius","birthday":"November 30","extra":"Pavo Ocellus","ver":"1.0","lore":"Cavalry Captain of the Knights, adopted by the Ragnvindr family as a child. He is the last heir of Khaenri'ah's Alberich line, a secret that broke his bond with Diluc.","art":true},{"id":"kamisato_ayaka","name":"Kamisato Ayaka","title":"Frostflake Heron","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Inazuma","faction":"Yashiro Commission","birthday":"September 28","extra":"Grus Nivis","ver":"2.0","lore":"The Shirasagi Himegimi, daughter of the Yashiro Commission's Kamisato Clan. Graceful in public and lonely in private, she quietly shelters those who lost their Visions.","art":true},{"id":"kamisato_ayato","name":"Kamisato Ayato","title":"Pillar of Fortitude","el":"Hydro","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Inazuma","faction":"Yashiro Commission","birthday":"March 26","extra":"Cypressus Custos","ver":"2.6","lore":"Head of the Kamisato Clan and Yashiro Commissioner. He took the post young after his parents died and plays politics so that Ayaka does not have to.","art":true},{"id":"kaveh","name":"Kaveh","title":"Empyrean Reflection","el":"Dendro","weapon":"Claymore","rarity":4,"region":"Sumeru","faction":"Independent Design Studio","birthday":"July 9","extra":"Paradisaea","ver":"3.6","lore":"The architect of the Palace of Alcazarzaray, bankrupted by his own masterpiece. He rents a room from Alhaitham and argues with him daily.","art":true},{"id":"keqing","name":"Keqing","title":"Driving Thunder","el":"Electro","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Liyue","faction":"Liyue Qixing","birthday":"November 20","extra":"Trulla Cementarii","ver":"1.0","lore":"The Yuheng of the Qixing, who dared to question the gods before it was safe to. After Rex Lapis's passing she works harder than anyone to prove humans can rule themselves.","art":true},{"id":"kinich","name":"Kinich","title":"Turnfire Hunt","el":"Dendro","weapon":"Claymore","rarity":5,"region":"Natlan","faction":"Huitztlan","birthday":"November 11","extra":"Chimaera Alebriius","ver":"5.0","lore":"A saurian hunter of the Scions of the Canopy, bound by contract to the dragon Ajaw, who is waiting to take his body.","art":true},{"id":"kirara","name":"Kirara","title":"Cat Upon the Eaves","el":"Dendro","weapon":"Sword","rarity":4,"region":"Inazuma","faction":"Komaniya Express","birthday":"January 22","extra":"Arcella","ver":"3.7","lore":"A nekomata courier for Komaniya Express who loves the human world and delivers anywhere.","art":true},{"id":"klee","name":"Klee","title":"Fleeing Sunlight","el":"Pyro","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":5,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Knights of Favonius","birthday":"July 27","extra":"Trifolium","ver":"1.0","lore":"The Spark Knight, a child with a gift for explosives and a permanent seat in solitary confinement. Her mother is the witch Alice.","art":true},{"id":"kujou_sara","name":"Kujou Sara","title":"Crowfeather Kaburaya","el":"Electro","weapon":"Bow","rarity":4,"region":"Inazuma","faction":"Tenryou Commission","birthday":"July 14","extra":"Flabellum","ver":"2.1","lore":"General of the Tenryou Commission, a tengu adopted into the Kujou Clan. Her loyalty to the Shogun survives the discovery of her own clan's treason.","art":true},{"id":"kuki_shinobu","name":"Kuki Shinobu","title":"Mender of Tribulations","el":"Electro","weapon":"Sword","rarity":4,"region":"Inazuma","faction":"Arataki Gang","birthday":"July 27","extra":"Tribulatio Demptio","ver":"2.7","lore":"Deputy of the Arataki Gang. She walked away from life as a shrine maiden and holds enough licences to get the gang out of any trouble.","art":true},{"id":"lan_yan","name":"Lan Yan","title":"Spring Woven From Jade","el":"Anemo","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":4,"region":"Liyue","faction":"Chenyu Vale","birthday":"January 6","extra":"Hirundo Lazuli","ver":"5.3","lore":"A rattan weaver from Chenyu Vale, quick and bright as a swallow.","art":true},{"id":"lauma","name":"Lauma","title":"Evermoon's Sacrament Song","el":"Dendro","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":5,"region":"Nod-Krai","faction":"Frostmoon Scions","birthday":"March 1","extra":"Cerva Nivea","ver":"6.0","lore":"The Moonchanter of the Frostmoon Scions, a horned maiden who hears the forest and prays to a moon goddess who cannot hear her.","art":true},{"id":"layla","name":"Layla","title":"Fantastical Evening Star","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Sword","rarity":4,"region":"Sumeru","faction":"Rtawahist","birthday":"December 19","extra":"Luscinia","ver":"3.2","lore":"A Rtawahist student of astrology who never gets enough sleep. A second self finishes her papers while she dreams.","art":true},{"id":"linnea","name":"Linnea","title":"Augur of Wonders","el":"Geo","weapon":"Bow","rarity":5,"region":"Nod-Krai","faction":"Adventurers' Guild","birthday":"May 23","extra":"Alcyon","ver":"6.5","lore":"A naturalist and adviser to the Adventurers' Guild in Nod-Krai who would rather be in the field than behind a desk.","art":true},{"id":"lisa","name":"Lisa","title":"Witch of Purple Rose","el":"Electro","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":4,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Knights of Favonius","birthday":"June 9","extra":"Tempus Fugit","ver":"1.0","lore":"The Knights' languid librarian and the finest graduate Sumeru Akademiya had seen in two centuries. She came home wary of what great knowledge costs.","art":true},{"id":"lohen","name":"Lohen","title":"Sharpened Arrowhead","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":5,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Knights of Favonius","birthday":"April 3","extra":"Lepus Miles","ver":"6.6","lore":"Vice Captain of the Knights' Ranged Company, a spear fighter who leads crossbowmen from the very front line.","art":true},{"id":"lynette","name":"Lynette","title":"Elegance in the Shadows","el":"Anemo","weapon":"Sword","rarity":4,"region":"Fontaine","faction":"Hotel Bouffes d'ete","birthday":"February 2","extra":"Felis Alba","ver":"4.0","lore":"Lyney's twin and silent assistant, sharp-eyed and loyal. Arlecchino rescued her from a nobleman who meant to keep her.","art":true},{"id":"lyney","name":"Lyney","title":"Spectacle of Phantasmagoria","el":"Pyro","weapon":"Bow","rarity":5,"region":"Fontaine","faction":"Hotel Bouffes d'ete","birthday":"February 2","extra":"Felis Fuscus","ver":"4.0","lore":"A famed stage magician and a child of the House of the Hearth. He is Arlecchino's chosen successor and brother to Lynette and Freminet.","art":true},{"id":"mavuika","name":"Mavuika","title":"Night-Igniting Flame","el":"Pyro","weapon":"Claymore","rarity":5,"region":"Natlan","faction":"Huitztlan","birthday":"August 28","extra":"Sol Invictus","ver":"5.3","lore":"The Pyro Archon, a human who won the Sacred Flame five hundred years ago and slept through the centuries to lead the last war against the Abyss.","art":true},{"id":"mika","name":"Mika","title":"Coordinates of Clear Frost","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":4,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Knights of Favonius","birthday":"August 11","extra":"Palumbus","ver":"3.5","lore":"A Front-Line Surveyor of the Knights who returned ahead of Varka's expedition carrying a letter for Jean.","art":true},{"id":"mitya","name":"Mitya","title":"Rules Set at Naught","el":"Electro","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":5,"region":"Snezhnaya","faction":"Royal Energy Commission of Snezhnaya","birthday":"February 8","extra":"Nodus Gordianus","ver":"7.2","lore":"A brilliant energy specialist of Snezhnaya's Royal Energy Commission and an expert at avoiding his own schedule.","art":true},{"id":"mona","name":"Mona","title":"Astral Reflection","el":"Hydro","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":5,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Mondstadt","birthday":"August 31","extra":"Astrolabos","ver":"1.0","lore":"A proud and penniless astrologist whose readings are never wrong. She is the disciple of Barbeloth, one of the witches of the Hexenzirkel.","art":true},{"id":"mualani","name":"Mualani","title":"Splish-Splash Wavechaser","el":"Hydro","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":5,"region":"Natlan","faction":"Meztli","birthday":"August 3","extra":"Phoca Neomonachus","ver":"5.0","lore":"A guide of the People of the Springs and Natlan's best surfer, cheerful enough to carry a whole team.","art":true},{"id":"nahida","name":"Nahida","title":"Physic of Purity","el":"Dendro","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":5,"region":"Sumeru","faction":"Sumeru City","birthday":"October 27","extra":"Sapientia Oromasdis","ver":"3.2","lore":"Lesser Lord Kusanali, the Dendro Archon, a branch of Irminsul born after Rukkhadevata's sacrifice. The sages confined her for five hundred years.","art":true},{"id":"navia","name":"Navia","title":"Helm of the Radiant Rose","el":"Geo","weapon":"Claymore","rarity":5,"region":"Fontaine","faction":"Spina di Rosula","birthday":"August 16","extra":"Rosa Multiflora","ver":"4.3","lore":"President of the Spina di Rosula. She lost her father to a false verdict, and her closest companions to the flood.","art":true},{"id":"nefer","name":"Nefer","title":"Secret Beneath the Sands","el":"Dendro","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":5,"region":"Nod-Krai","faction":"Curatorium of Secrets","birthday":"May 9","extra":"Ludus Latrunculorum","ver":"6.1","lore":"Owner of the Curatorium of Secrets in Nasha Town. She came from the desert and trades in information the way others trade in Mora.","art":true},{"id":"neuvillette","name":"Neuvillette","title":"Ordainer of Inexorable Judgment","el":"Hydro","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":5,"region":"Fontaine","faction":"Court of Fontaine","birthday":"December 18","extra":"???","ver":"4.1","lore":"Iudex of Fontaine and the reborn Hydro Dragon Sovereign. He presided over its courts for centuries and at last pardoned its people of their original sin.","art":true},{"id":"nicole","name":"Nicole","title":"Clamor Within","el":"Pyro","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":5,"region":"Beyond","faction":"Hexenzirkel","birthday":"September 29","extra":"Reliquiarium","ver":"6.6","lore":"N of the Hexenzirkel, a voiceless angel and seer who has watched Teyvat's story since before the moons fell.","art":true},{"id":"nilou","name":"Nilou","title":"Dance of Lotuslight","el":"Hydro","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Sumeru","faction":"Zubayr Theater","birthday":"December 3","extra":"Lotos Somno","ver":"3.1","lore":"The star dancer of the Zubayr Theater, whose Sabzeruz Festival dance for Nahida the sages tried to ban.","art":true},{"id":"ningguang","name":"Ningguang","title":"Eclipsing Star","el":"Geo","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":4,"region":"Liyue","faction":"Liyue Qixing","birthday":"August 26","extra":"Opus Aequilibrium","ver":"1.0","lore":"The Tianquan of the Liyue Qixing. She rose from selling goods barefoot on the shore to owning the Jade Chamber, and gave it up to save the harbor.","art":true},{"id":"noelle","name":"Noelle","title":"Chivalric Blossom","el":"Geo","weapon":"Claymore","rarity":4,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Knights of Favonius","birthday":"March 21","extra":"Parma Cordis","ver":"1.0","lore":"A maid of the Knights who dreams of knighthood and fails the selection exam year after year. She is far stronger than she believes.","art":true},{"id":"odette","name":"Odette","title":"Swirling Snow","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Snezhnaya","faction":"Korolevskiy Troupe","birthday":"February 20","extra":"Cygnus Olor","ver":"7.0","lore":"A celebrated ballerina of the Korolevskiy Troupe, with a beauty as sharp as the frost she dances on.","art":true},{"id":"ororon","name":"Ororon","title":"Shadow of the Night-Wind","el":"Electro","weapon":"Bow","rarity":4,"region":"Natlan","faction":"Mictlan","birthday":"October 14","extra":"Vampyrum Spectrum","ver":"5.2","lore":"A youth of the Masters of the Night-Wind born with a damaged soul. Citlali raised him, and Capitano trusted him.","art":true},{"id":"prune","name":"Prune","title":"Childlike Dreams Cherished","el":"Anemo","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":4,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Mondstadt","birthday":"November 20","extra":"Turris Venefica","ver":"6.6","lore":"A tiny self-declared Witch Hunter who walked from Nod-Krai to Mondstadt to bring one particular witch to justice.","art":true},{"id":"qiqi","name":"Qiqi","title":"Icy Resurrection","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Liyue","faction":"Bubu Pharmacy","birthday":"March 3","extra":"Pristina Nola","ver":"1.0","lore":"A child herb gatherer caught in a battle between adepti, revived as a zombie and sealed in amber for centuries. She gives herself orders to keep going.","art":true},{"id":"raiden_shogun","name":"Raiden Shogun","title":"Plane of Euthymia","el":"Electro","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":5,"region":"Inazuma","faction":"Inazuma City","birthday":"June 26","extra":"Imperatrix Umbrosa","ver":"2.1","lore":"Ei, the Electro Archon. After losing her twin Makoto and her friends, she sealed herself in the Plane of Euthymia and left a puppet to rule in pursuit of eternity.","art":true},{"id":"razor","name":"Razor","title":"Wolf Boy","el":"Electro","weapon":"Claymore","rarity":4,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Wolvendom","birthday":"September 9","extra":"Lupus Minor","ver":"1.0","lore":"A boy raised by the wolves of Wolvendom. Varka gave him his name and a sword, and Lisa taught him to command lightning.","art":true},{"id":"rosaria","name":"Rosaria","title":"Thorny Benevolence","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":4,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Church of Favonius","birthday":"January 24","extra":"Spinea Corona","ver":"1.4","lore":"A sister of the Church who never attends service. Rescued from bandits by Varka, she does the work in the dark that keeps Mondstadt clean.","art":true},{"id":"sandrone","name":"Sandrone","title":"Mirrored Analysis","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Claymore","rarity":5,"region":"Snezhnaya","faction":"Fatui","birthday":"January 13","extra":"Narcissorolegium","ver":"6.7","lore":"Marionette, Seventh of the Fatui Harbingers. An engineer who reads the world as mathematics and never misses a tea party.","art":true},{"id":"sangonomiya_kokomi","name":"Sangonomiya Kokomi","title":"Pearl of Wisdom","el":"Hydro","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":5,"region":"Inazuma","faction":"Watatsumi Island","birthday":"February 22","extra":"Dracaena Somnolenta","ver":"2.1","lore":"Divine Priestess of Watatsumi Island and strategist of the resistance. She plans every battle on paper and saves her energy for the people who rely on her.","art":true},{"id":"sayu","name":"Sayu","title":"Mujina Ninja","el":"Anemo","weapon":"Claymore","rarity":4,"region":"Inazuma","faction":"Shuumatsuban","birthday":"October 19","extra":"Nyctereutes Minor","ver":"2.0","lore":"A tiny ninja of the Shuumatsuban whose only ambitions are sleeping and growing taller.","art":true},{"id":"sethos","name":"Sethos","title":"Wisdom's Measure","el":"Electro","weapon":"Bow","rarity":4,"region":"Sumeru","faction":"Temple of Silence","birthday":"May 31","extra":"Basileos Delta","ver":"4.7","lore":"Heir to the Temple of Silence. As a child he was given half of an ancient priestly spirit, and in the end he passed it to Cyno.","art":true},{"id":"shenhe","name":"Shenhe","title":"Lonesome Transcendence","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":5,"region":"Liyue","faction":"Cloud Retainer's Abode","birthday":"March 10","extra":"Crista Doloris","ver":"2.4","lore":"A daughter of exorcists offered to a god by her own father. Cloud Retainer raised her and bound her soul with red ropes to hold back her killing intent.","art":true},{"id":"shikanoin_heizou","name":"Shikanoin Heizou","title":"Analytical Harmony","el":"Anemo","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":4,"region":"Inazuma","faction":"Tenryou Commission","birthday":"July 24","extra":"Cervus Minor","ver":"2.8","lore":"The Tenryou Commission's detective prodigy, who believes solving a case early enough is the only way to prevent the next crime.","art":true},{"id":"sigewinne","name":"Sigewinne","title":"Wondrous Dragonheir","el":"Hydro","weapon":"Bow","rarity":5,"region":"Fontaine","faction":"Fortress of Meropide","birthday":"March 30","extra":"Nereides","ver":"4.7","lore":"The head nurse of the Fortress of Meropide, a Melusine who studies humans with clinical affection.","art":true},{"id":"skirk","name":"Skirk","title":"Void Star","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Beyond","faction":"Cosmic Calamity","birthday":"November 5","extra":"Crystallina","ver":"5.7","lore":"A solitary swordswoman from beyond Teyvat and a disciple of Surtalogi. She trained a young Childe in the Abyss, and later walked into Teyvat herself.","art":true},{"id":"sucrose","name":"Sucrose","title":"Harmless Sweetie","el":"Anemo","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":4,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Knights of Favonius","birthday":"November 26","extra":"Ampulla","ver":"1.0","lore":"A shy alchemist who assists Albedo and specialises in bio-alchemy. She dreams of creating a land full of wonders.","art":true},{"id":"tartaglia","name":"Tartaglia","title":"Childe","el":"Hydro","weapon":"Bow","rarity":5,"region":"Snezhnaya","faction":"Fatui","birthday":"July 20","extra":"Monoceros Caeli","ver":"1.1","lore":"Childe, Eleventh of the Fatui Harbingers. He fell into the Abyss as a boy, was trained there by Skirk, and has loved a good fight ever since.","art":true},{"id":"thoma","name":"Thoma","title":"Protector From Afar","el":"Pyro","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":4,"region":"Inazuma","faction":"Yashiro Commission","birthday":"January 9","extra":"Rubeum Scutum","ver":"2.2","lore":"The Kamisato Clan's housekeeper and fixer, born in Mondstadt. The Shogun marked his Vision as the hundredth to be taken, and the Traveler stopped it.","art":true},{"id":"tighnari","name":"Tighnari","title":"Verdant Strider","el":"Dendro","weapon":"Bow","rarity":5,"region":"Sumeru","faction":"Gandharva Ville","birthday":"December 29","extra":"Vulpes Zerda","ver":"3.0","lore":"Forest Watcher of Gandharva Ville, a fennec-eared botanist who left the Akademiya because the forest needed him more.","art":true},{"id":"valeriy","name":"Valeriy","title":"Fort Fulguration","el":"Electro","weapon":"Sword","rarity":4,"region":"Snezhnaya","faction":"Fatui Grenadier Guards First Regiment","birthday":"March 24","extra":"Ursus Magnus","ver":"7.2","lore":"Commander of a special battalion in the Fatui Grenadier Guards, trusted to protect key people and keep operations on course.","art":true},{"id":"varesa","name":"Varesa","title":"Strength in Serenity","el":"Electro","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":5,"region":"Natlan","faction":"Teteocan","birthday":"November 15","extra":"Mascara Luctatori","ver":"5.5","lore":"An easy-going orchard keeper of the Collective of Plenty who dreams of being a hero and eats like one.","art":true},{"id":"varka","name":"Varka","title":"Knight of Boreas","el":"Anemo","weapon":"Claymore","rarity":5,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Knights of Favonius","birthday":"February 17","extra":"Lupus Majoris","ver":"6.4","lore":"Grand Master of the Knights of Favonius and Knight of Boreas. He led most of the order on a years-long expedition and left Mondstadt in Jean's hands.","art":true},{"id":"venti","name":"Venti","title":"Windborne Bard","el":"Anemo","weapon":"Bow","rarity":5,"region":"Mondstadt","faction":"Mondstadt","birthday":"June 16","extra":"Carmen Dei","ver":"1.0","lore":"A bard with a taste for wine who is in truth Barbatos, the Anemo Archon. He wears the face of a friend who died in the rebellion that freed old Mondstadt.","art":true},{"id":"vesna","name":"Vesna","title":"Snowy Banquet's Sharp Blade","el":"Anemo","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Snezhnaya","faction":"Druzhna","birthday":"February 4","extra":"Amentum Vernum","ver":"7.1","lore":"Commander of the Druzhna, the Tsaritsa's own guard, and her keenest blade.","art":true},{"id":"vodyanitsa","name":"Vodyanitsa","title":"Lingering Siren-Song","el":"Hydro","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":5,"region":"Snezhnaya","faction":"Korolevskiy Troupe","birthday":"March 29","extra":"Piscicula Aurea","ver":"7.1","lore":"Prima donna of the Korolevskiy Troupe, a Water Imp who left her own kind for the stage.","art":true},{"id":"wanderer","name":"Wanderer","title":"Eons Adrift","el":"Anemo","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":5,"region":"Sumeru","faction":"","birthday":"January 3","extra":"Peregrinus","ver":"3.3","lore":"Once Scaramouche the Harbinger, a puppet made and abandoned by Ei. He tried to erase himself from Irminsul, failed, and took a new name from the Traveler.","art":true},{"id":"wriothesley","name":"Wriothesley","title":"Emissary of Solitary Iniquity","el":"Cryo","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":5,"region":"Fontaine","faction":"Fortress of Meropide","birthday":"November 23","extra":"Cerberus","ver":"4.1","lore":"Duke and warden of the Fortress of Meropide. Sentenced there as a boy for killing his murderous foster parents, he rose to run it.","art":true},{"id":"xiangling","name":"Xiangling","title":"Exquisite Delicacy","el":"Pyro","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":4,"region":"Liyue","faction":"Wanmin Restaurant","birthday":"November 2","extra":"Trulla","ver":"1.0","lore":"Head chef of Wanmin Restaurant, fearless with strange ingredients. Her companion Guoba is the faded form of the Stove God Marchosius.","art":true},{"id":"xianyun","name":"Xianyun","title":"Passerine Herald","el":"Anemo","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":5,"region":"Liyue","faction":"Mt. Aocang","birthday":"April 11","extra":"Grus Serena","ver":"4.4","lore":"Cloud Retainer, an adeptus inventor of great pride and many words, guardian to Ganyu and Shenhe. She now lives among mortals.","art":true},{"id":"xiao","name":"Xiao","title":"Vigilant Yaksha","el":"Anemo","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":5,"region":"Liyue","faction":"Liyue Adeptus","birthday":"April 17","extra":"Alatus Nemeseos","ver":"1.3","lore":"The Vigilant Yaksha and last survivor of the five yakshas. Freed from a cruel god by Morax, he has spent millennia fighting the remnants of fallen gods.","art":true},{"id":"xilonen","name":"Xilonen","title":"Ardent Flames Forge the Soul","el":"Geo","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Natlan","faction":"Nanatzcayan","birthday":"March 13","extra":"Panthera Ocelota","ver":"5.1","lore":"Natlan's finest smith, a leopard-eared craftswoman of the Children of Echoes who forges Ancient Names.","art":true},{"id":"xingqiu","name":"Xingqiu","title":"Juvenile Galant","el":"Hydro","weapon":"Sword","rarity":4,"region":"Liyue","faction":"Feiyun Commerce Guild","birthday":"October 9","extra":"Fabulae Textile","ver":"1.0","lore":"Second son of the Feiyun Commerce Guild, a bookworm who trained in the Guhua sword arts and practises chivalry in secret.","art":true},{"id":"xinyan","name":"Xinyan","title":"Blazing Riff","el":"Pyro","weapon":"Claymore","rarity":4,"region":"Liyue","faction":"The Red Strings","birthday":"October 16","extra":"Fila Ignium","ver":"1.1","lore":"Liyue's first rock and roll musician, who plays against prejudice with fire and a home-made guitar.","art":true},{"id":"yae_miko","name":"Yae Miko","title":"Astute Amusement","el":"Electro","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":5,"region":"Inazuma","faction":"Grand Narukami Shrine","birthday":"June 27","extra":"Divina Vulpes","ver":"2.5","lore":"Guuji of the Grand Narukami Shrine, a kitsune and Ei's oldest living friend. She runs the Yae Publishing House and engineered the Traveler's meeting with the Shogun.","art":true},{"id":"yanfei","name":"Yanfei","title":"Wise Innocence","el":"Pyro","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":4,"region":"Liyue","faction":"Yanfei Legal Consultancy","birthday":"July 28","extra":"Bestia Iustitia","ver":"1.5","lore":"Liyue's top legal adviser, half illuminated beast. Born in peacetime, she is bound by no contract and chose the law out of love for it.","art":true},{"id":"yaoyao","name":"Yaoyao","title":"Burgeoning Grace","el":"Dendro","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":4,"region":"Liyue","faction":"Streetward Rambler's Abode","birthday":"March 6","extra":"Osmanthus","ver":"3.4","lore":"A young disciple of the adeptus Streetward Rambler who looks after everyone older than her, especially Qiqi.","art":true},{"id":"yelan","name":"Yelan","title":"Valley Orchid","el":"Hydro","weapon":"Bow","rarity":5,"region":"Liyue","faction":"Yanshang Teahouse","birthday":"April 20","extra":"Umbrabilis Orchis","ver":"2.7","lore":"An intelligence agent who answers to Ningguang, officially a clerk of the Ministry of Civil Affairs. Her ancestors fought and died in the Chasm.","art":true},{"id":"yoimiya","name":"Yoimiya","title":"Frolicking Flames","el":"Pyro","weapon":"Bow","rarity":5,"region":"Inazuma","faction":"Naganohara Fireworks","birthday":"June 21","extra":"Carassius Auratus","ver":"2.0","lore":"Owner of Naganohara Fireworks and the Queen of the Summer Festival. She believes a single bright moment can stay with a person forever.","art":true},{"id":"yumemizuki_mizuki","name":"Yumemizuki Mizuki","title":"Embrace of Enchanting Dreams","el":"Anemo","weapon":"Catalyst","rarity":5,"region":"Inazuma","faction":"Inazuma","birthday":"March 16","extra":"Tapirus Somniator","ver":"5.4","lore":"A baku who works as a clinical psychologist and part-owns Aisa Bathhouse, eating the nightmares of Inazuma.","art":true},{"id":"yun_jin","name":"Yun Jin","title":"Stage Lucida","el":"Geo","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":4,"region":"Liyue","faction":"Yun-Han Opera Troupe","birthday":"May 21","extra":"Opera Grandis","ver":"2.4","lore":"Director of the Yun-Han Opera Troupe, a master of Liyue opera with a private love of rock music.","art":true},{"id":"zhongli","name":"Zhongli","title":"Vago Mundo","el":"Geo","weapon":"Polearm","rarity":5,"region":"Liyue","faction":"Liyue Harbor","birthday":"December 31","extra":"Lapis Dei","ver":"1.1","lore":"A consultant of the Wangsheng Funeral Parlor and the retired Geo Archon, Morax. After six thousand years he ended his own reign with one last contract.","art":true},{"id":"zibai","name":"Zibai","title":"White Horse's Fleeting Spring","el":"Geo","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Liyue","faction":"Liyue Harbor","birthday":"May 15","extra":"Equa Alba","ver":"6.3","lore":"The White Horse Adeptus of Liyue's oldest legends, who rode with Rex Lapis in the Archon War and then vanished from history.","art":true},{"id":"traveler","name":"Traveler","title":"Outlander","el":"","weapon":"Sword","rarity":5,"region":"Beyond","faction":"","birthday":"","extra":"Viator / Viatrix","ver":"1.0","lore":"An outlander who crossed worlds with a twin and lost them to an unknown god. Wakes in Teyvat centuries later and walks the seven nations looking for answers.","art":false}],"lines":[{"f":"kamisato_ayaka","t":"thoma","s":"","q":"Thoma is a dear friend. He always lifts my spirits with his sunny disposition. In a sense, I think of him as another brother, and as a full member of the Kamisato Clan."},{"f":"kamisato_ayaka","t":"kujou_sara","s":"","q":"Kujou Sara of the Tenryou Commission is... not known to smile, and I have had my fair share of disputes with her. She is, however, a loyal servant to Inazuma, there is no question about that."},{"f":"kamisato_ayaka","t":"shikanoin_heizou","s":"","q":"Mr. Shikanoin belongs to the Tenryou Commission, just like Miss Kujou. He is very... principled, sometimes even more determinedly so than Miss Kujou. …"},{"f":"kamisato_ayaka","t":"sayu","s":"","q":"Ah, little Sayu. She hasn't been causing you any trouble lately, has she? Hehe, if you ever notice her slacking off, please let me know."},{"f":"jean","t":"barbara","s":"","q":"Barbara is a hard worker, but I feel she's too hard on herself sometimes... What? You ask me how I know all of this? It's because the order also manages the Church."},{"f":"jean","t":"lisa","s":"","q":"When Lisa is around, I always have peace of mind."},{"f":"jean","t":"amber","s":"","q":"I must say that Amber's development has impressed me recently. I hope that one day, her deeds will become the words of a bard's tale."},{"f":"jean","t":"kaeya","s":"","q":"Is that right...? Kaeya also gave you some suggestions. He is an excellent knight after all — this is a fact no one can deny."},{"f":"lisa","t":"jean","s":"","q":"Jean is a gifted and dedicated leader. Seeing how hard she works makes even me want to help her out."},{"f":"lisa","t":"amber","s":"","q":"Amber was just a young girl when she joined the knights, and in the blink of an eye, she's turned into such a strong young lady. I'm curious to see what she'll be like a few years from now."},{"f":"lisa","t":"barbara","s":"","q":"Have you heard Barbara sing before? Her angelic voice contains a magical healing energy. A different kind of magical energy from the one in my potions, of course. I wonder which one you prefer?"},{"f":"lisa","t":"diluc","s":"","q":"You want to know about Diluc? Haha, in that case, I know someone else you should talk to."},{"f":"barbara","t":"jean","s":"","q":"Acting Grand Master... Leader of the Knights of Favonius... Everyone seems to like her a lot. Oh? Me? I... Of course I have nothing but admiration for her!"},{"f":"barbara","t":"lisa","s":"","q":"I always take good care of Lisa. If she ever wants to become a star, she'll have my unconditional support, I'll cheer at the top of my lungs until my voice goes hoarse... …"},{"f":"barbara","t":"venti","s":"","q":"Venti's voice is amazing! But all the songs he sings and the ones I'm good at are very different. I tried to learn them but... the melodies are just so complicated."},{"f":"barbara","t":"bennett","s":"","q":"Bennett always comes to the cathedral covered in scrapes and bruises... Though it clearly never bothers him a bit, given the big grin he always has on his face. …"},{"f":"kaeya","t":"jean","s":"","q":"What? The Acting Grand Master? You need to give her your full support."},{"f":"kaeya","t":"amber","s":"","q":"That Outrider is a clever and righteous knight. Be careful not to step out of line in front of her."},{"f":"kaeya","t":"diluc","s":"","q":"Diluc? He was cute as a young lad. But nowadays he just seems to be in a world of his own... Overall, not much fun to hang out with."},{"f":"kaeya","t":"klee","s":"","q":"Klee. Seems she has failed to elude the Acting Grand Master's investigative skills, despite the pointers I gave her... Haha, I'm kidding, no need to go reporting me or anything."},{"f":"diluc","t":"kaeya","s":"","q":"Kaeya? You can only trust half of what he says... at best."},{"f":"diluc","t":"lisa","s":"","q":"I believe Lisa has the potential to become the most reliable of the knights. If she's willing."},{"f":"diluc","t":"jean","s":"Enemies","q":"Trifling matters can become Jean's greatest enemy."},{"f":"diluc","t":"mona","s":"","q":"The land of Mondstadt, by the Anemo Archon's grace, is bountiful. I see no need for the harvest forecasts of astrologers."},{"f":"razor","t":"lisa","s":"","q":"Lisa lightning makes the sky black. She is strong. She is scary."},{"f":"razor","t":"venti","s":"","q":"Razor doesn't know poems, but... Lupical likes them."},{"f":"razor","t":"bennett","s":"","q":"Bennett... Much talking. Eat with him, never full."},{"f":"razor","t":"klee","s":"","q":"Klee, friend! Friend, but... big hassle."},{"f":"amber","t":"jean","s":"Help","q":"After the Grand Master left on his expedition, all the affairs of the Knights of Favonius, both big and small, have been left up to Jean. If only there was more I could do to help her..."},{"f":"amber","t":"lisa","s":"Listening to Stories","q":"When you have time, we should go see Lisa! Last time I saw her, she was telling me about a story involving a treasure in the Dragonspine area. But, we got cut off before she could finish. …"},{"f":"amber","t":"kaeya","s":"Concerns","q":"...I'm feeling uneasy all of a sudden! Was that Kaeya with you earlier? Did he give you any trouble?"},{"f":"amber","t":"bennett","s":"","q":"Hmm? Bennett... I feel like I've heard that name before... Oh! Yes, he's that hot-blooded guy from the Adventurers' Guild, right! …"},{"f":"venti","t":"barbara","s":"","q":"The darling Deaconess with the sweet singing voice — do you know her? You do? Idol, huh? Meet and greets? Concerts? Wow... That's the power of music for you..."},{"f":"venti","t":"razor","s":"","q":"Ah yes, the white-haired fellow from Wolvendom? Raised by wolves? Really? ... No wonder his scent is so familiar..."},{"f":"venti","t":"mona","s":"","q":"Oh, that astrologer? How should I put it? Fortune-telling and my singing are the same: Both lead to you being so poor you can't even cough up the money for a drink! …"},{"f":"venti","t":"diona","s":"","q":"There's a special drink known far and wide at Cat's Tail. But it ah... ahh... ACHOO! *sniffs* How about you go and fetch one for me? I'll be truly thankful, I promise."},{"f":"xiangling","t":"ningguang","s":"","q":"That was the Tianquan! Did you see? She just walked past. Come here... closer... Let me tell you, she knows everything that happens in Liyue, so... keep a low profile, don't attract her attention!"},{"f":"xiangling","t":"hu_tao","s":"","q":"Is Hu Tao picking on you too? Ugh, that prankster always waits till I least expect it, creeps up on me from behind and then... Boo! ...then laughs herself silly. Hmph. …"},{"f":"xiangling","t":"diona","s":"","q":"Diona, from Springvale! Ah, I heard she mixes a great drink, so I came specifically to see her! I thought perhaps I could use her secrets in my cooking, and bring out more flavors. …"},{"f":"xiangling","t":"beidou","s":"","q":"Oh, Beidou is the greatest! Every time I go out sailing with her, she always manages to fish up lots of fresh ingredients! …"},{"f":"beidou","t":"ningguang","s":"Liyue Qixing","q":"Ningguang, eh? As far as Liyue Qixing is concerned, she seems to be doing a good job. But for me, my responsibility lies with my ship and my men, and not with Liyue Qixing."},{"f":"beidou","t":"xiangling","s":"Culinary Skills","q":"When we're out on the open ocean, the one thing we do all miss is Xiangling's cooking. When spirits are low, just thinking of her fried jueyun chili, bursting with flavor... …"},{"f":"beidou","t":"xiao","s":"","q":"One year on the eve of the Lantern Rite, we ran into a storm as we were returning to port. …"},{"f":"beidou","t":"ganyu","s":"","q":"Privately, Ganyu and I get on like a house on fire! But as you know, she's the secretary to the Liyue Qixing... and I'm not exactly in their good books right now! …"},{"f":"xingqiu","t":"ningguang","s":"","q":"In her capacity as the Tianquan, I am obliged to respect her. Otherwise, it could create issues for my father and brother. On a personal level? Let me think... I think I will go with \"no comment.\" …"},{"f":"xingqiu","t":"chongyun","s":"","q":"Ah, dear Chongyun. Though he understands me quite well, one has to exercise caution when teaming up with him to go on a quest. …"},{"f":"xingqiu","t":"yun_jin","s":"","q":"When Yun Jin drinks a beverage she is fond of, she will be inspired to write a new play. …"},{"f":"xingqiu","t":"hu_tao","s":"","q":"Ah yes, the young lady who is now the Master of the Wangsheng Funeral Parlor. If you're asking what I think about her as a person... Well, there are all sorts of rumors about the way she works. …"},{"f":"xiao","t":"zhongli","s":"","q":"Can I ask... Zhongli — what does he do with his days? Huh? Birds, antiques, flowers... Hmm... What deeper meaning do they hold?"},{"f":"xiao","t":"beidou","s":"","q":"Beidou? I have nothing to do with her. Though there is such a thing as the leviathan. As a mere human, she has proven her power in defeating Haishan."},{"f":"xiao","t":"baizhu","s":"","q":"You want... Baizhu to make a medicine to take away my pain? I understand your intentions, but mortal medicine has no effect on adepti."},{"f":"xiao","t":"hu_tao","s":"","q":"Hu Tao? Her liveliness is irritating. Fortunately, she is also humorous, so you need not worry about her growing into a boring human."},{"f":"ningguang","t":"beidou","s":"Fines","q":"That... captain. She clearly receives the adoration of many, but will always be the first to disregard the rules. The fines she has paid would be enough to buy her a whole new ship..."},{"f":"ningguang","t":"zhongli","s":"","q":"Zhongli... Of the Wangsheng Funeral Parlor. He's very versed in a great deal of affairs. Although... such excellent pawns are of no use to me until I know their weaknesses."},{"f":"ningguang","t":"xingqiu","s":"","q":"The second son of the Feiyun Commerce Guild. People like him can't stand the sight of me, which is only to be expected. I have no intention of troubling him either. …"},{"f":"ningguang","t":"xiangling","s":"","q":"That girl from Wanmin Restaurant... Her suspicion towards me is always written all over her face... …"},{"f":"klee","t":"razor","s":"","q":"Razor's one of my best buddies! Whenever a disaster happens, he always knows the best way to fix it and helps keep Klee safe. Um, but most of the time I'm the one who caused the disaster..."},{"f":"klee","t":"kaeya","s":"","q":"Kaeya is the best! He wrote the Favonius Survival Rulebook for me and he always helps me cover it up when I make a big disaster."},{"f":"klee","t":"amber","s":"","q":"Amber is the best! Baron Bunny is so fluffy and he even explodes! So. Cool."},{"f":"klee","t":"jean","s":"","q":"Master Jean is the best! But she's also a little bit scary."},{"f":"zhongli","t":"xiao","s":"","q":"You speak of the young adeptus of Guili Plains... *sigh* Still fulfilling his duty to this very day. Please, give this Remedium Tertiorum to him on my behalf. Oh, yes... …"},{"f":"zhongli","t":"venti","s":"","q":"*sniff* Tsk... It reeks of wine. That bard has just been through here, hasn't he? That drunkard is a disgrace to the arts. Oh... Has he tricked you into getting drunk? You're slurring a little. …"},{"f":"zhongli","t":"ningguang","s":"","q":"Despite the multitude of affairs that she deals with in a day, Ningguang always continues to press on. A rare gem indeed. …"},{"f":"zhongli","t":"hu_tao","s":"","q":"The current overseer of the funeral parlor? Ahem. I cannot deal with that child."},{"f":"fischl","t":"bennett","s":"","q":"Fischl: Ah, the ill-starred young man... My Auge der Verurteilung has seen with unmistakable clarity how his heart ails at being forsaken by the world— Oz: Someone needs to keep an eye on the unlucky…"},{"f":"fischl","t":"lisa","s":"","q":"Fischl: The magus-custodian of books, gatekeeper of universal knowledge... Win her trust, and one may yet gain access to a vast repository of wisdom... …"},{"f":"fischl","t":"kaeya","s":"","q":"Fischl: His nature is obscure, his fate a mystery, and his speech a vexing tapestry woven of both fact and fiction... Perhaps he and I share the burden of mystical sight... …"},{"f":"fischl","t":"mona","s":"","q":"Fischl: Aha, yes, Mona, the mighty astrologer... Mona, who once had the vanity to probe the fate of the Prinzessin der Verurteilung herself! She wound up a trembling wreck, overborne and overmastered. …"},{"f":"bennett","t":"barbara","s":"","q":"She's the best singer and dancer out there! I always go to watch her in concert after an adventure goes south — it really lifts my mood, chanting along with all the other fans, cheering her on. …"},{"f":"bennett","t":"klee","s":"","q":"She's a cute kid... but I have to keep my distance. Whenever she plays with me, her bombs always end up going off... …"},{"f":"bennett","t":"fischl","s":"","q":"Oh yeah, the Prinzessin der Verurteilung from the world beyond! She's amazing. …"},{"f":"bennett","t":"razor","s":"","q":"Wolvendom guy! Looks a little on the feral side... doesn't talk much... but he's alright! We both love eating meat, so we got that in common. …"},{"f":"tartaglia","t":"skirk","s":"","q":"It's been years since I last saw my master. I should hope that next we meet, I'll at least be able to force her to use both hands to beat me..."},{"f":"tartaglia","t":"zhongli","s":"Pondering","q":"There's far more to that man than meets the eye. As for the extent of his power... lots to look forward to, I think."},{"f":"tartaglia","t":"columbina","s":"","q":"The Fatui Harbingers are ranked by strength, and I have no idea why that girl is No. 3. I'd test my skills with every Harbinger who ranks above me if I had the chance, but when it comes to her... …"},{"f":"tartaglia","t":"arlecchino","s":"","q":"Look, I've got nothing against people who have their own agendas — I myself joined the Fatui to get more experience in combat. But I don't like her at all. …"},{"f":"noelle","t":"amber","s":"","q":"I really look up to Amber. Not only is she an accomplished knight, but she's a kind person too. She taught me how to make a Baron Bunny. …"},{"f":"noelle","t":"jean","s":"","q":"Master Jean has always been my role model, both in terms of ability and dedication. …"},{"f":"noelle","t":"varka","s":"","q":"At first I wanted to join his expedition party and do my part as a maid. But the Grand Master said no — it would give him more peace of mind if I stayed behind to take care of things in Mondstadt. …"},{"f":"noelle","t":"kaeya","s":"","q":"He's a mysterious character! He comes and goes like the wind, and is always occupied with important business. …"},{"f":"qiqi","t":"baizhu","s":"","q":"I can never remember Dr. Baizhu's face. But I don't mind."},{"f":"qiqi","t":"hu_tao","s":"","q":"Warm. Fake smile. Death. I despise Hu Tao."},{"f":"qiqi","t":"yaoyao","s":"","q":"Cute. Like a nice little finch."},{"f":"qiqi","t":"prune","s":"","q":"She looks tough on the outside... but her palms are nice and soft. I like her."},{"f":"chongyun","t":"xingqiu","s":"","q":"I do admire Xingqiu for his devotion to chivalry and his martial arts proficiency. However — I must warn you that he definitely has a mean side, too. …"},{"f":"chongyun","t":"hu_tao","s":"","q":"The Wangsheng Funeral Parlor is a reputable institution that acts with integrity. But whenever I see that cheeky smile that says, \"It's nothing you exorcists need to worry about,\" …"},{"f":"chongyun","t":"xinyan","s":"","q":"I avoid Xinyan's performances like the plague. That heated atmosphere... Even if you don't intend to get involved, it still... Let's just say that it gets me all hot and bothered."},{"f":"chongyun","t":"xiangling","s":"","q":"Xiangling's cooking is universally praised, but I personally don't touch any of her spicy dishes. Why? Oh, you know — just, uh... personal preference, that's all. …"},{"f":"ganyu","t":"zhongli","s":"Trust","q":"I have absolute faith in Rex Lapis. It was only through his leadership that we were able to repel the monsters and subdue the sea creatures, and thus protect the peace of Liyue. …"},{"f":"ganyu","t":"ningguang","s":"","q":"Each Tianquan adds their own interpretation and amendments to the founding laws of Liyue. …"},{"f":"ganyu","t":"keqing","s":"Estrangement","q":"I cannot stand her disrespectful attitude towards Rex Lapis! But he says to me, \"Ganyu, this is just the kind of person Liyue needs in this day and age.\" …"},{"f":"ganyu","t":"xiangling","s":"","q":"Xiangling is a celebrity! Um, but... I try to avoid her restaurant. Just... because. No reason. ...Okay, fine. It's not a big secret anyway. …"},{"f":"albedo","t":"sucrose","s":"Direction","q":"Sucrose? I think I more or less understand why she is so dedicated to her research in bio-alchemy... Either way, I'm happy to see her succeed more and more in her endeavors."},{"f":"albedo","t":"lisa","s":"","q":"Lisa? I always am impressed by the valuable perspectives she brings to discussions. But is a person with her talents satisfied with such a basic occupation as librarian? …"},{"f":"albedo","t":"klee","s":"","q":"Indeed, I view Klee as my younger sister. Whenever she gets herself into some explosive sort of trouble, I can only console myself with the fact that her current destructiveness is nothing compared…"},{"f":"albedo","t":"jean","s":"","q":"Jean? She has served exceptionally well as Acting Grand Master. One can even say she is more reliable than Grand Master Varka. …"},{"f":"diona","t":"diluc","s":"","q":"Diluc... I can't stand him! If there was no Diluc, there would be no Mondstadt wine industry; if there was no Mondstadt wine industry, Daddy wouldn't drink; and if Daddy didn't drink... …"},{"f":"diona","t":"kaeya","s":"","q":"How is it that even a captain is a disgusting boozehound! You know, that guy who's got that laugh! He downs drink after drink. Ugh!"},{"f":"diona","t":"venti","s":"","q":"Venti? I'm not familiar with him... He's a bard? Oh, he must be that guy who sings tunes to entertain the drunkards. Well, then I don't like him, no no no..."},{"f":"diona","t":"xiangling","s":"","q":"Xiangling once gave me a \"so-awful-it-goes-with-nothing\" food combination she came up with, saying how it tasted absolutely terrible, blah blah blah... It didn't work, no use at all. …"},{"f":"mona","t":"klee","s":"","q":"Ah yes, Alice's daughter. She's in the custody of the Knights of Favonius, and Albedo looks after her too. She's blessed to have Trifolium as her constellation, which represents good luck. …"},{"f":"mona","t":"diluc","s":"","q":"Diluc Ragnvindr. His constellation, Noctua, represents vigilance in the darkness of night... …"},{"f":"mona","t":"lisa","s":"","q":"A Tempus Fugit... The constellation derives its name from the hourglass, and stands for knowledge and time — or rather, the trade-off between them. …"},{"f":"mona","t":"venti","s":"","q":"Venti? The bard that sits around doing nothing all day? What's so interesting about him? Sure, I guess I can take a look... Huh, that's weird, the scryglass, it's... I can't see a thing... …"},{"f":"keqing","t":"zhongli","s":"","q":"The gentleman from the Wangsheng Funeral Parlor? Clearly, he's an extremely learned individual, and I do have a lot of respect for him. …"},{"f":"keqing","t":"ningguang","s":"Conflict","q":"We do work together, but we couldn't be more opposite personality-wise. To her, Liyue Harbor is nothing more than a marketplace, and she'll do anything as long as it makes money for her. …"},{"f":"keqing","t":"baizhu","s":"","q":"Everyone has faith in Dr. Baizhu's medical skills. He's the right guy to go to when you can't figure out what's wrong with you. Oh... the rumors, you say? …"},{"f":"keqing","t":"ganyu","s":"Skepticism","q":"Who knows what Rex Lapis must have done to inspire such blind devotion from Ganyu... But her reluctance to be critical is not without its advantages. …"},{"f":"sucrose","t":"klee","s":"","q":"Jean has put her into solitary confinement so many times, but every time she's let out it's not long before she's back in trouble. *sigh* Something tells me she hasn't done much introspection. …"},{"f":"sucrose","t":"jean","s":"","q":"I don't dare talk to Master Jean that much, because she's so strict. I know she's a good person and all — I know that, I do — but... I still find her scary. …"},{"f":"sucrose","t":"lisa","s":"","q":"She really seems to know a great deal. She's obviously never seen my research, and yet on so many occasions she's given me advice on that which is most core to my studies. Just how does she know? …"},{"f":"sucrose","t":"kaeya","s":"","q":"Oh... I know he likes to joke, and isn't trying to make fun of me, but I often struggle to work out which parts of what he says are the truth and which parts are jokes. …"},{"f":"xinyan","t":"xiangling","s":"","q":"I have dinner at the Wanmin Restaurant often. If Xiangling's got some time on her hands, we'll chat till it's real late. Eh? You wanna know what I order? See... I actually eat everything she makes. …"},{"f":"xinyan","t":"beidou","s":"","q":"Her? She speaks her mind and has a big heart, and we get on great. The Crux's adventures are real epic. They've given me tons of inspiration in the past! I even wrote them a song. …"},{"f":"xinyan","t":"chongyun","s":"","q":"He's one interesting guy. He looks introverted enough, but there was this one time when he came to one of my performances. …"},{"f":"xinyan","t":"yun_jin","s":"","q":"Tell you a secret — but you gotta keep it that way, you hear? She's real fond of rock 'n' roll. Comes to watch me at least three times a week no matter how packed her schedule is. …"},{"f":"rosaria","t":"kaeya","s":"","q":"Wine has its uses... like revealing someone's true colors, for example. Smooth talk is Kaeya's veil, but being me, I can see right through it. Hah, you should see him when he's drunk."},{"f":"rosaria","t":"barbara","s":"","q":"Barbara is like a thorn in my side, always nagging me about mass and choir practice. I wouldn't be surprised if Sister Victoria specifically asked her to keep an eye on me."},{"f":"rosaria","t":"jean","s":"","q":"She's not only competent in her own work but also somehow manages to clear up various matters for others... Huh. Now that's a woman who deserves admiration."},{"f":"rosaria","t":"varka","s":"","q":"I'm sure Varka means well, but his long-winded conversations get real old real quick. Although, he does really care for those around him, doesn't he?"},{"f":"hu_tao","t":"zhongli","s":"","q":"Zhongli looks young, but his personality is a bit dusty. Knows everything, but doesn't fret over anything. Hmm... Couldn't be that he's a... Hehe, forget it, whatever."},{"f":"hu_tao","t":"qiqi","s":"","q":"Have you seen Qiqi? Tell me where she is, quickly. I need to go seal her away, hee-hee!"},{"f":"hu_tao","t":"baizhu","s":"","q":"Baizhu? Ugh, that guy..."},{"f":"hu_tao","t":"xingqiu","s":"","q":"I hear master Xingqiu is writing a book? Standard novella, or a ghost story? I think I should go tell him about all the things I run into — that'd make for a really good read!"},{"f":"kaedehara_kazuha","t":"beidou","s":"","q":"I owe Beidou my life. She took me in when I fled from Inazuma and gave me the courage to return there at the most difficult time of my life. …"},{"f":"kaedehara_kazuha","t":"gorou","s":"","q":"When I was a wanted man, the resistance gave me a lot of help. The time I spent with Gorou was brief, but he left a deep impression on me. He's the type of person who says whatever's on his mind. …"},{"f":"kaedehara_kazuha","t":"yoimiya","s":"","q":"The last time she commissioned Captain Beidou to ship fireworks to Liyue, I unloaded the shipment myself. They were so heavy! I doubt that anyone besides her could make such huge fireworks."},{"f":"kaedehara_kazuha","t":"sangonomiya_kokomi","s":"","q":"During my time with the Resistance, there was no one among our ranks who wouldn't look up to Her Excellency. …"},{"f":"yanfei","t":"ganyu","s":"","q":"Ganyu is kind and thoughtful, it's just a shame she's so busy all the time. Most of the time, she's buried in an endless pile of paperwork — the only exception being her nap at noon. …"},{"f":"yanfei","t":"zhongli","s":"","q":"Mr. Zhongli has so much in-depth knowledge on so many topics, he's like a walking library, you know what I mean? He's a total savant, though he never flaunts it. I could tell just by looking at him. …"},{"f":"yanfei","t":"ningguang","s":"","q":"You must have heard of the Tianquan, Ningguang? She's the highest authority where the law is concerned, and often makes amendments to the legal codices. …"},{"f":"yanfei","t":"keqing","s":"","q":"The Yuheng doesn't deal with matters of the law, and thank goodness... Knowing Keqing's attitude toward work and ruthless efficiency, I'd end up losing a lot of work. Although... …"},{"f":"yoimiya","t":"raiden_shogun","s":"","q":"Fireworks are probably the furthest thing from the \"eternity\" that the Shogun pursues. She probably feels that their transient glory has no practical purpose in Inazuma. …"},{"f":"yoimiya","t":"kamisato_ayaka","s":"Seriousness","q":"We cooperate a lot due to work. Unlike people in the other two Commissions, she always lets me finish speaking and answers me seriously without showing any impatience. I'd say that the word \"ladylike\" …"},{"f":"yoimiya","t":"thoma","s":"","q":"He's quite the talker and has reasons behind every word that he says. …"},{"f":"yoimiya","t":"yae_miko","s":"","q":"Ayaka once asked me during a ritual at the shrine if I could prepare some fireworks for the Lady Guuji's leisure. …"},{"f":"thoma","t":"raiden_shogun","s":"Comparison","q":"In my homeland of Mondstadt, almost everyone has great reverence for the Anemo Archon, Barbatos. But people in Inazuma feel a little differently toward the Shogun. How can I put this... …"},{"f":"thoma","t":"kamisato_ayato","s":"","q":"As head of the Kamisato Clan, he's in a tough position. With all the political upheaval, he has to contend with public disquiet on one hand and a bunch of self-serving, degenerate public officials on…"},{"f":"thoma","t":"kamisato_ayaka","s":"","q":"Milady is in all respects a well-rounded person: erudite, compassionate, well-mannered, and elegant... The one thing she could do better is to speak her mind more. …"},{"f":"thoma","t":"yoimiya","s":"","q":"Of Naganohara Fireworks fame? She's so easy to get along with. Super straightforward, just says whatever she thinks. …"},{"f":"eula","t":"amber","s":"","q":"Amber's someone who thinks for herself. On the day I first joined the Knights, she cleaned my dormitory and gave me a tour of the headquarters, and she's helped me with a myriad of other things in…"},{"f":"eula","t":"jean","s":"","q":"The Acting Grand Master's family and mine are sworn enemies. But she draws a clear line between professional and personal matters. …"},{"f":"eula","t":"varka","s":"","q":"Hmph, the Grand Master... He doesn't like to beat around the bush and has no care for rumors or trivial matters. A good guy, I guess. …"},{"f":"eula","t":"venti","s":"","q":"I heard that bard sing a few songs about the Lawrence Clan... They were lighthearted and funny stories that mocked the clan in a way I've never heard anyone else do. …"},{"f":"raiden_shogun","t":"yae_miko","s":"","q":"Ah, that girl... She used to be the kind of person who could easily be swayed with some Fried Tofu. It's a relief to see how shrewd and resourceful she's now become. …"},{"f":"raiden_shogun","t":"kamisato_ayato","s":"","q":"Kamisato... One of the most distinguished clans in all of Inazuma. Despite Ayato's trickery in regard to the Tri-Commission's affairs, he is nevertheless a loyal subject. …"},{"f":"raiden_shogun","t":"kamisato_ayaka","s":"","q":"Kamisato... One of the most distinguished clans in all of Inazuma. Eh? That's exactly what the Shogun said? Well, A—Ayaka's also well-versed in the art of the sword."},{"f":"raiden_shogun","t":"kujou_sara","s":"","q":"A loyal and righteous subject, and an accomplished warrior. She is worthy to be called a hero. With an heir of such great promise, the future prosperity of the Kujou Clan is assured."},{"f":"sayu","t":"kamisato_ayaka","s":"","q":"As the eldest daughter of the Kamisato Clan, she always looks very graceful and elegant. But she got one of the shrine maidens to keep tabs on me and make sure I don't slack off... …"},{"f":"sayu","t":"kamisato_ayato","s":"","q":"Sometimes, when I'm taking a rest up in a tree, I overhear the shrine maidens talking about him. Sounds like he's pretty important and super busy most of the time. …"},{"f":"sayu","t":"thoma","s":"","q":"He's got a Vision, and yet for some reason he pesters me about learning ninjutsu every time I run into him. I don't know what his deal is. …"},{"f":"sayu","t":"yoimiya","s":"","q":"Every time she sees me she says, \"Hey, little tanuki! Let's go hang out at the festival.\" Firstly, I'm not a tanuki. Secondly, I don't wanna go to a festival. …"},{"f":"sangonomiya_kokomi","t":"gorou","s":"","q":"Gorou is an exceptional general... sincere, determined, and courageous. He has a strong camaraderie with the troops and is able to come up with creative battle plans. …"},{"f":"sangonomiya_kokomi","t":"kujou_sara","s":"","q":"Mmm... I must admit, Kujou Sara is an opponent that cannot be taken lightly. She seldom employs cunning strategy, but her performance in open warfare is always admirable. …"},{"f":"sangonomiya_kokomi","t":"yae_miko","s":"","q":"I have also heard of Guuji Yae's great deeds. In all fairness, I hold her to be an outstanding shrine maiden, and she has performed her duties marvelously. …"},{"f":"sangonomiya_kokomi","t":"raiden_shogun","s":"","q":"Now that the Vision Hunt Decree is over, Watatsumi Island has once again returned to normal life. …"},{"f":"gorou","t":"kaedehara_kazuha","s":"","q":"I've seen all kinds of wandering samurai before, and Kazuha is categorically a different breed from the others. He's like a gust of wind that sweeps through the land. …"},{"f":"gorou","t":"sangonomiya_kokomi","s":"Duties","q":"As the leader of Watatsumi Island, Her Excellency is responsible for assessing the scenario and formulating a plan. …"},{"f":"gorou","t":"kujou_sara","s":"","q":"I have nothing good to say about the Shogun's Army, but Kujou Sara is perhaps the most honorable officer among their ranks. …"},{"f":"gorou","t":"yae_miko","s":"","q":"Oh, her... I'd prefer not to talk about her. Can we change the topic? Or, if there are any tasks I can take off your hand, I'll gladly oblige! Anything at all? …"},{"f":"kujou_sara","t":"thoma","s":"","q":"The Tenryou Commission's estate is very large. It would serve us well to have a fine housekeeper like Thoma who could keep all the numerous and disparate household affairs in order. …"},{"f":"kujou_sara","t":"kamisato_ayaka","s":"","q":"In the Kujou household, normally the only sound to be heard is that of soldiers training in the dojo. But in the Kamisato household, there is the sound of music, dance, bickering, and laughter... …"},{"f":"kujou_sara","t":"yoimiya","s":"","q":"As long as she is not setting off fireworks in my camp, I will cause her no trouble. …"},{"f":"kujou_sara","t":"shikanoin_heizou","s":"","q":"Shikanoin and I may be colleagues, but I have few positive words to say about him. He seems preoccupied with his personal schemes while official duties take second place. …"},{"f":"arataki_itto","t":"thoma","s":"","q":"Some of the boys have been telling me that he was the star of the show at the Vision Hunt Ceremony. I'm like — are you kidding me??? How come he gets his own special ceremony!? …"},{"f":"arataki_itto","t":"kamisato_ayato","s":"","q":"Haha, I only wish I could have met my bro Ayato sooner. He really taught me something. \"You can kindle the warrior spirit in even the weakest of bugs\"... Yep, I really took that one to heart. …"},{"f":"arataki_itto","t":"yoimiya","s":"","q":"Hmph, she's always showing off her fancy fireworks and toys to the kids. Well, I'm sick of it! Nobody steals my thunder! I'm the one that's supposed to be adored by the kids! Me! …"},{"f":"arataki_itto","t":"raiden_shogun","s":"","q":"During the Vision Hunt Decree, the Shogun had to send her top tengu in person to get my Vision off me. Heh, means she must have found me to be quite the pain in the neck. …"},{"f":"yae_miko","t":"raiden_shogun","s":"","q":"Locking herself away in the Plane of Euthymia when she clearly wants to be out — it's just willful self-torture, really... On the other hand, it's also rather stubborn-but-cute, don't you think?"},{"f":"yae_miko","t":"kamisato_ayato","s":"","q":"The Yashiro rascal... he's always been an unpredictable one, even as a child. Don't be taken in by his warm smile. …"},{"f":"yae_miko","t":"kamisato_ayaka","s":"","q":"I'm very fond indeed of the Yashiro Commission girl. She adroitly handles every matter that comes before her. Unfortunately, it's often thankless work. Pity. …"},{"f":"yae_miko","t":"kujou_sara","s":"","q":"Not the sharpest tengu in the forest — she certainly didn't inherit the brilliant mind of daddy tengu, that's for sure. *sigh* How shall I put this? …"},{"f":"shikanoin_heizou","t":"kujou_sara","s":"","q":"Madam Kujou Sara? Yeah, that lady's gotta be the most serious person in the entire Tenryou Commission. …"},{"f":"shikanoin_heizou","t":"kuki_shinobu","s":"","q":"The Arataki Gang is a free and diverse organization that accepts anyone, regardless of their background. Pretty amazing if you ask me. They're lucky to have Shinobu to help keep them all in line. Hmm? …"},{"f":"shikanoin_heizou","t":"kaedehara_kazuha","s":"Things in Common","q":"Oh, Kazuha? Yeah, he's a solid guy. With his help, I felt like a locked treasure chest of clues had been bust wide open and emptied all over the ground for me to see. …"},{"f":"shikanoin_heizou","t":"gorou","s":"","q":"General Gorou's constant suspicion made my trip to Watatsumi Island much more eventful... Everywhere I went, there were soldiers keeping me under close surveillance. …"},{"f":"yelan","t":"ningguang","s":"Relationship","q":"I got to know Ningguang a long time ago, before she was a Qixing, and we worked together for a while. Maybe I'm partly to thank for the fact that she became a Qixing so quickly. Hehe, who can say? …"},{"f":"yelan","t":"ganyu","s":"","q":"Ah, the secretary... I could never work non-stop like she does, certainly not at that level of efficiency. I guess being half-adeptus must have its perks. …"},{"f":"yelan","t":"keqing","s":"","q":"I don't really like people who cram their schedules full, because it doesn't leave any room for negotiation. …"},{"f":"yelan","t":"yanfei","s":"","q":"I like Yanfei a lot. And I'm not talking about our friendship — as a high-profile legal consultant, important intel in Liyue Harbor is constantly flowing in her direction. …"},{"f":"kirara","t":"yae_miko","s":"","q":"Lady Miko is a widely renowned kitsune youkai in Inazuma, so it's natural for young youkai like myself to approach her with reverence. But contrary to my expectations, she was surprisingly amiable. …"},{"f":"kirara","t":"kujou_sara","s":"","q":"I've always wanted to have a chat with the Lady Tengu. Maybe it's because she's the general of the Tenryou Commission, but I find her quite intimidating, so I've only ever watched her from afar. …"},{"f":"kirara","t":"chiori","s":"","q":"She's really nice to me. I often ran into her in the past when she was out researching ways to make fabrics and develop color palettes. …"},{"f":"kirara","t":"raiden_shogun","s":"","q":"Parcels sent to Tenshukaku are all packaged intricately with multiple layers of wrapping. Maybe that's what they call a package fit for the Almighty Shogun. Some of them smell really good... …"},{"f":"shenhe","t":"ningguang","s":"","q":"I have no use for the wealth that ordinary people desire. But in the hands of Lady Ningguang, wealth becomes a means of solving complex issues of the kind that no weapons could ever hope to resolve. …"},{"f":"shenhe","t":"yun_jin","s":"","q":"Yun Jin performs... It's called \"Liyue opera,\" isn't it? I like this particular type of social interaction. …"},{"f":"shenhe","t":"ganyu","s":"","q":"I've heard many stories about her from my master. She's really quite different from how I originally imagined her... But don't worry, I'll be keeping this to myself. …"},{"f":"shenhe","t":"chongyun","s":"","q":"It's hard for me to believe that... I still have living relatives in this world. If he has any difficulties with his training, I am more than willing to help enlighten him. …"},{"f":"yun_jin","t":"xinyan","s":"","q":"The elders of the troupe are always harping on about rock 'n' roll being a bad influence. Needless to say, they never approve of me going to see Xinyan's shows. \"It's for your own good,\" they say. …"},{"f":"yun_jin","t":"hu_tao","s":"","q":"Ah yes, Hu Tao. Very expressive face, and she has a sharp mind too — you can be discussing the most mundane thing in the world, and she'll always bring out a string of witty remarks. …"},{"f":"yun_jin","t":"ningguang","s":"","q":"The Tianquan is a big spender and has made several very generous donations to our troupe. I can only return her generosity by delivering my best possible performance."},{"f":"yun_jin","t":"xingqiu","s":"","q":"Oh, so you are also acquainted with Xingqiu? Haha, he is quite the clever one, and with a sharp wit as well. …"},{"f":"kuki_shinobu","t":"kujou_sara","s":"","q":"Madam Kujou? Yes, she's a friend of mine. Hmm? You're surprised that I know her? Oh, you must've misunderstood, I knew her from before I joined the Arataki Gang. …"},{"f":"kuki_shinobu","t":"yae_miko","s":"","q":"You can't imagine how boring it is to be a shrine maiden. Even Lady Guuji from the Grand Narukami Shrine has her publishing gig to break up the monotony. I will never go back to being a shrine maiden. …"},{"f":"kuki_shinobu","t":"arataki_itto","s":"","q":"The boss has a lot of unpleasant memories from his past, but he still manages to stay positive. I'd say that kind of resilience is pretty rare. …"},{"f":"kuki_shinobu","t":"yanfei","s":"","q":"Back then I had an argument with my family and I only wanted to run away as far as I could. So, I went to study law in Liyue, but thanks to this experience, I got to meet Yanfei. …"},{"f":"kamisato_ayato","t":"kamisato_ayaka","s":"","q":"I am confident in Ayaka's abilities. But I want her to be able to hold on to her innocence. …"},{"f":"kamisato_ayato","t":"thoma","s":"","q":"There is no doubt in my mind about Thoma's loyalty to the Kamisato Clan. …"},{"f":"kamisato_ayato","t":"sayu","s":"","q":"She looks awfully idle the majority of the time, and yet when it counts, she always rises to the occasion and provides indispensable assistance. …"},{"f":"kamisato_ayato","t":"raiden_shogun","s":"","q":"The cost of pursuing eternity has been great for the Almighty Shogun... and for all of Inazuma. …"},{"f":"collei","t":"tighnari","s":"","q":"Although Master can be quite stern and is always criticizing adventurers for carelessly eating poisonous mushrooms, he is actually a gentle soul. …"},{"f":"collei","t":"nahida","s":"","q":"The Dendro Archon... When I was a kid, there were so many times when I just wanted to scream out to the gods and ask them why, why did I have to go through so much pain...? …"},{"f":"collei","t":"cyno","s":"","q":"Um... I'd rather not talk about him, if that's okay? Oh, no — the General Mahamatra isn't a bad guy or anything. …"},{"f":"collei","t":"kaveh","s":"","q":"The General Mahamatra once brought him to our place for a meal. From the moment the fruit arrived on the table, he ranted non-stop about his difficult and stubborn roommate for the entire meal. …"},{"f":"dori","t":"tighnari","s":"","q":"He loves learning as much as I love Mora. I heard he makes a lot of little interesting gadgets, but he refuses to partner with me to mass produce them. …"},{"f":"dori","t":"alhaitham","s":"","q":"He once came nosing around, asking my minions some questions to see what he could find out. Like I said, those Akademiya people are just pig-headed and dishonest. …"},{"f":"dori","t":"kaveh","s":"","q":"Ah yeah, he's one of the Kshahrewar people that I work with. Unlike the more closed-minded people at the Akademiya, he actually has his own dreams that he's fighting for. …"},{"f":"dori","t":"dehya","s":"","q":"I hire her to help escort my caravans from time to time. After all, she's got the muscle, and her price is reasonable. When it comes to cost-performance ratio, she's always the best pick."},{"f":"tighnari","t":"collei","s":"","q":"When that child was first brought here, she was effectively illiterate. It wasn't a huge issue, though. She's a hard worker and a diligent student, so she's made good progress. …"},{"f":"tighnari","t":"cyno","s":"General Mahamatra","q":"You want to see Cyno...? Well, firstly, a word of caution: if he ever comes chasing you down for work-related reasons, prepare for the nightmare of a lifetime. …"},{"f":"tighnari","t":"alhaitham","s":"","q":"Be careful of Alhaitham. I'm not saying he's a bad guy, but he purely operates by rationality, so people often find his actions unacceptable. …"},{"f":"tighnari","t":"kaveh","s":"","q":"Kaveh is a famous architect in Sumeru. The Palace of Alcazarzaray is his magnum opus. During the initial planning, he even asked me to recommend suitable ornamental flora. …"},{"f":"nilou","t":"cyno","s":"","q":"I don't really like interacting with people from the Akademiya because they don't view the arts too kindly. I often wonder what they do when they're bored... Huh, Cyno plays Genius Invokation TCG? …"},{"f":"nilou","t":"collei","s":"","q":"She sometimes comes to watch my performances. She's a really hard-working Trainee Forest Ranger. One time, she warned me about getting lost. What did she mean by that? …"},{"f":"nilou","t":"kaveh","s":"","q":"I heard he was the one who built the magnificent Palace of Alcazarzaray. He must have had a wonderful time making such a masterpiece, like when I'm in the middle of dance practice. …"},{"f":"nilou","t":"dehya","s":"","q":"It's hard to believe that so many things have happened recently... I wanted to pick out a good present for Dehya and Dunyarzad, but I just can't make up my mind. …"},{"f":"cyno","t":"tighnari","s":"Knowledge","q":"Tighnari is different from other scholars I've met. He has the same wholehearted dedication to knowledge, but he will never cross the most important boundaries. …"},{"f":"cyno","t":"collei","s":"","q":"I once helped Collei seal away the god's remains in her body, but the process was an unthinkably painful one. …"},{"f":"cyno","t":"alhaitham","s":"","q":"I don't really like people who are too smart. They think they can control everything, and constantly venture to the fringes of danger. But Alhaitham is one of the more reliable ones. …"},{"f":"cyno","t":"kaveh","s":"","q":"Tighnari and Collei never said it to my face, but they found Kaveh's personal anecdotes far more entertaining than the jokes I had prepared... I could see it on their faces. Hmm? …"},{"f":"candace","t":"layla","s":"","q":"An eccentric girl who always seems to be in a trance...? Yes, I believe I've seen her before — near the Wall of Samiel. …"},{"f":"candace","t":"dehya","s":"","q":"Whenever Dehya brings any of her Eremites to stay at Aaru Village, she always keeps them on their best behavior. I have to say, it makes my life a lot easier. Ah, Dehya... …"},{"f":"candace","t":"sethos","s":"","q":"The sons and daughters of King Deshret are a proud people, and he is no exception. I have heard his tale, of Hermanubis's glory dwelling within a worthy vessel. …"},{"f":"candace","t":"nahida","s":"","q":"Perhaps it is a testament to the Dendro Archon's benevolence that I, a descendant of the Al-Ahmar bloodline, am able to live peacefully on this land. …"},{"f":"nahida","t":"cyno","s":"Jokes","q":"His jokes are like buried treasure: gems hidden beneath the surface. They're a lot of fun. Hmm? Well, which part didn't you get? Okay, I can explain it for you."},{"f":"nahida","t":"tighnari","s":"","q":"The Forest Watchers played an essential role in helping the rainforest to withstand the Withering and continue to flourish, and Tighnari is the best of them all. Still... …"},{"f":"nahida","t":"collei","s":"","q":"When I heard her story for the first time, her tenacity shone through like a dazzling gemstone. She's been through so much... …"},{"f":"nahida","t":"alhaitham","s":"","q":"He holds a body of knowledge more advanced than most could imagine, and his mind is constantly thinking, so maybe nothing in this world could ever fool him. …"},{"f":"layla","t":"candace","s":"","q":"...Huh, I saw someone who matches that description when I woke up after sleepwalking for the first time. \"Candace,\" huh? Now I know. I still remember the moment I woke up... …"},{"f":"layla","t":"faruzan","s":"","q":"Has Professor Faruzan managed to get any students? People from the Haravatat Darshan say that she always has difficulty getting funding for her projects, so it's hard for her to attract students, too. …"},{"f":"layla","t":"mona","s":"","q":"Mona Megistus, the Astrologist... Her astrology column in The Steambird is well-known among Rtawahist scholars. …"},{"f":"layla","t":"lisa","s":"","q":"Oh, I know who you're talking about. Lisa Minci — the legendary Spantamad prodigy who graduated in just two years. If only I had her brains... Huh? You met her in person when you were in Mondstadt? …"},{"f":"wanderer","t":"nahida","s":"","q":"While I still had value as a pawn, she might have had other reasons to keep me alive. …"},{"f":"wanderer","t":"raiden_shogun","s":"","q":"She completely neglected her own creation, and to add insult to injury, she said it was because she \"couldn't bring herself to intervene\" in my fate..."},{"f":"wanderer","t":"tartaglia","s":"","q":"He's simple of mind and not that strong of body. Naming him to the lowest-ranked seat lowered the Harbingers' collective prestige. Thankfully, I'm no longer part of that group."},{"f":"wanderer","t":"yae_miko","s":"","q":"A smooth-talking youkai. Though she pretends to care about humans to gain the favor of her god, all she seeks are entertaining ways to pass her time."},{"f":"faruzan","t":"nahida","s":"","q":"Knowledge is naturally something that cannot be limited or restrained. It's like how Kshahrewar can utilize Haravatat's research findings. …"},{"f":"faruzan","t":"tighnari","s":"","q":"One of my favorite projects is researching rainforest ruins. Ah right, I should ask Tighnari to come with me next time. It's always fun to travel with the living copy of the Rainforest Survival Guide. …"},{"f":"faruzan","t":"collei","s":"","q":"Ah, Collei... She's respectful toward her elders, diligent, and has a hard-working attitude — truly the perfect student! Children like her deserve all the affection and praise. …"},{"f":"faruzan","t":"cyno","s":"","q":"Cyno's jokes are composed using modern words and language patterns, but I still struggle to decipher any hidden meaning from his grammar and prose... Huh? …"},{"f":"yaoyao","t":"xiangling","s":"","q":"Xiangling hasn't been, um... looking for strange ingredients lately, has she? She gave me a real fright last time. She said she was about to try some raw octopus from the Sea of Clouds. …"},{"f":"yaoyao","t":"qiqi","s":"Friends","q":"Qiqi's my best friend! She forgets who I am sometimes, but I know she doesn't mean it... I just have to remind her to check her notebook, and she remembers me right away."},{"f":"yaoyao","t":"baizhu","s":"","q":"Dr. Baizhu's prescriptions are pretty effective. They're bitter, that's for sure, but they always say that about medicine: \"the bitter the better\"! So I get it. Huh? Too bitter for you? …"},{"f":"yaoyao","t":"ganyu","s":"","q":"Ganyu always has a lot of work to do. I heard that one time, she was so tired she accidentally fell asleep on the grass. *sigh* I do worry about her, you know! Hmm, maybe... …"},{"f":"alhaitham","t":"nahida","s":"","q":"One should neither dismiss nor overly revere the divine. Gods require followers, and they are also part of a biological hierarchy. …"},{"f":"alhaitham","t":"kaveh","s":"Overly Sensitive","q":"Kaveh tends to be overly sensitive about everyone and everything he crosses paths with, and he's constantly making a fuss about nothing. Maybe it's because he's too emotionally fragile..."},{"f":"alhaitham","t":"tighnari","s":"","q":"Apparently, a lot of people think he has a bad temperament, but I don't think they're giving him a fair chance. …"},{"f":"alhaitham","t":"dori","s":"","q":"She's sharp and always keeps an eye out for herself. She knows how to take life by the reins and make her dreams a reality. …"},{"f":"dehya","t":"tighnari","s":"","q":"Hahaha, the one that got away... I came thiiis close to doing a job for that guy. A contact put us in touch — I was supposed to be his guide through the desert for some kind of investigation. …"},{"f":"dehya","t":"candace","s":"","q":"Ah, Candace... I love her to bits, but she can be as stubborn as a Sumpter Beast sometimes. …"},{"f":"dehya","t":"alhaitham","s":"","q":"He offered me a position in the Akademiya once. I declined — working in a place like that would bore me to death. He, on the other hand, is exactly the kind of person I can imagine working there... …"},{"f":"dehya","t":"nilou","s":"","q":"Now that the whole saga with the Akademiya's over, I guess she can finally dance as much as she wants. …"},{"f":"mika","t":"kaeya","s":"","q":"Before joining the Knights, I had to take a number of exams. Captain Kaeya was the main person in charge of all the testing. …"},{"f":"mika","t":"varka","s":"Instruction","q":"Grand Master Varka is not only a strong leader who commands respect, but also my personal combat instructor. …"},{"f":"mika","t":"jean","s":"","q":"The Deputy... I mean, the Acting Grand Master is a strong and considerate leader who always makes me feel at ease. She's always out there looking after all of us. …"},{"f":"mika","t":"amber","s":"","q":"Oh? Amber the Outrider? She's the most reliable vanguard, and has amazing reconnaissance skills! …"},{"f":"kaveh","t":"nahida","s":"","q":"Lesser Lord Kusanali is a wise and capable god. Not only is she extremely knowledgeable, she also possesses virtue far beyond mortal comprehension. …"},{"f":"kaveh","t":"alhaitham","s":"Temperament","q":"I guarantee you'll never meet anyone else who's as infuriating as him! And for the record, yes, I would say that to his face. …"},{"f":"kaveh","t":"tighnari","s":"","q":"Ah, Tighnari... He's one of the nicest guys you could know. If you've met him, you'll know what I mean. …"},{"f":"kaveh","t":"dori","s":"","q":"Dori is the owner of the Palace of Alcazarzaray... Excuse me? Mine? No, don't be ridiculous. I know full well that it doesn't belong to me... I know, I know, but... argh, please, let's not go there! …"},{"f":"baizhu","t":"qiqi","s":"","q":"Yes, you've guessed correctly. The preservation of a thread of Qiqi's consciousness was in fact the work of the adepti. …"},{"f":"baizhu","t":"hu_tao","s":"Different Approach","q":"We have some differences in ideology, that's all. I don't harbor any ill-will toward Director Hu. If anything, I think she's more wary of me."},{"f":"baizhu","t":"keqing","s":"","q":"If I were to hazard a guess about her health from a face reading, I would presume the Yuheng's frequent looks of exhaustion are due to her long-time habits of burning the midnight oil and never…"},{"f":"baizhu","t":"yaoyao","s":"","q":"Every time she comes to play with Qiqi, she complains about the taste of medicine and asks me if I have anything that isn't bitter. …"},{"f":"lynette","t":"lyney","s":"Unspoken Understanding","q":"I have always been together with Lyney, and we can tell what the other is thinking without speaking. Thus, he tends to be more quiet than normal when we are alone. Hmm? …"},{"f":"lynette","t":"freminet","s":"","q":"He is a delicate and gentle child, but also tends to belittle himself... perhaps due to his previous experiences. Sometimes he feels like the antithesis of Lyney... …"},{"f":"lynette","t":"arlecchino","s":"","q":"Oh, how \"Father\" expresses love... well, not everyone can accept it. But it is only because of \"Father\" that home... can be called home."},{"f":"lynette","t":"chiori","s":"","q":"The costumes Lyney and I wear for performances were specially tailored by Chiori. Once, Lyney was using a small knife for a magic trick, and accidentally cut the cuff of his sleeve a bit. …"},{"f":"lyney","t":"arlecchino","s":"Family","q":"\"Father\" gave us a family, raised us, and told each of us what we should work towards. In turn, what I can do is very simple... Remain loyal, and protect our home."},{"f":"lyney","t":"lynette","s":"Modes","q":"You think my sister doesn't talk much? Oh, she's probably just not in the right mode. Next time, start by saying \"Activate Chat Mode\" to her. …"},{"f":"lyney","t":"freminet","s":"","q":"My naive little brother still believes in fairy tales. I envy him, really. Uh, just to be clear though, he didn't actually tell me that. …"},{"f":"lyney","t":"chiori","s":"","q":"Flattery won't get you anywhere with her. She'll only give those who can truly appreciate her art a second look. How does she see me, you ask? Come on now, that hurts! …"},{"f":"freminet","t":"arlecchino","s":"Tears","q":"\"Father\" doesn't like it when children cry. \"Father\" says tears are the product of emotion and weakness. So when \"Father\" scolds me, I hold it in until I'm underwater, where no one can hear me cry. …"},{"f":"freminet","t":"lyney","s":"Magic Shows","q":"At home, Lyney's always showing me his magic tricks. Whenever I smile, he grins excitedly and says the audience is definitely going to love this one... Do I really smile so rarely?"},{"f":"freminet","t":"lynette","s":"","q":"If you assigned Lyney and Lynette with the same mission, they'd both do an outstanding job. But not me. …"},{"f":"freminet","t":"charlotte","s":"","q":"For some reason, Charlotte never believes me when I say I'm just an ordinary diver. She's convinced that my past is full of news stories waiting for her to dig up... Am I really that bad of a liar?"},{"f":"wriothesley","t":"neuvillette","s":"","q":"I was once summoned by Neuvillette to discuss some matters with him in his office. When I approached the Palais Mermonia, I saw him standing by the road, completely drenched in the rain. …"},{"f":"wriothesley","t":"furina","s":"","q":"Miss Furina displayed a severe lack of interest in my trial and excused herself early, probably because I pleaded guilty to all charges as soon as they were announced. …"},{"f":"wriothesley","t":"sigewinne","s":"","q":"Sigewinne the head nurse possesses all the virtues associated with the medical profession and genuinely cares for the well-being of everyone around her. …"},{"f":"wriothesley","t":"clorinde","s":"","q":"Clorinde is the best Champion Duelist you can find. Her combat prowess is already the stuff of legend. I've never fought her myself, but that's because there's never been a need for it."},{"f":"neuvillette","t":"wriothesley","s":"","q":"Wriothesley is a trustworthy man. I fought hard for the title and reputation he now has. I expect you to think that I've simply been duped by his flattery and appearance of loyalty... …"},{"f":"neuvillette","t":"clorinde","s":"","q":"Clorinde's peerless skills have made her the most powerful Champion Duelist in our nation. …"},{"f":"neuvillette","t":"sigewinne","s":"","q":"I don't know how Sigewinne is faring these days. But if I hear so much as the whiff of a rumor that she's being bullied, I shall summon Wriothesley here and demand an explanation. …"},{"f":"neuvillette","t":"furina","s":"","q":"Now, the curtain has finally fallen on her \"performance\"... The character she portrayed was an imaginary one, yet in playing that role she fulfilled her duties... …"},{"f":"charlotte","t":"navia","s":"","q":"Now that her father's name's been cleared, and the case of the serial disappearances of young women is resolved, I guess Navia must be able to finally breathe a little easier. …"},{"f":"charlotte","t":"lyney","s":"","q":"Surprise, surprise — Lyney refused an interview with me once again. Do you know how many times that is now? ...Uh, actually, I've lost count. But never mind! …"},{"f":"charlotte","t":"lynette","s":"","q":"No matter what question you pose to her, Lynette just calmly lowers her eyes with an expressionless look on her face. It's like she's some sort of... clockwork doll. …"},{"f":"charlotte","t":"clorinde","s":"","q":"Clorinde is one of the most well-known Champion Duelists in Fontaine, but she's also the most mysterious. …"},{"f":"furina","t":"neuvillette","s":"","q":"I'm very grateful to Neuvillette for all the hard work he's done for Fontaine in the past few centuries. It seems he doesn't intend to investigate my crimes of deceiving the people. …"},{"f":"furina","t":"navia","s":"Desserts","q":"Have you tried Navia's macarons? I have to admit that her skills in dessert-making are comparable to mine. The design she paints on the macarons is so cute, don't you think? …"},{"f":"furina","t":"arlecchino","s":"","q":"The Knave? Wh—Who's that? Oh... Uh, I'd already forgotten about her... Keeping such a terrible figure like her in your mind will only give you nightmares."},{"f":"furina","t":"charlotte","s":"","q":"I've often seen Charlotte busily running back and forth lately. She still seems to be hoping to arrange an exclusive interview with me. No matter how many times I refuse, she still hasn't given up. …"},{"f":"chevreuse","t":"freminet","s":"","q":"I once saw Freminet in a shop when we both reached for the same gadget. …"},{"f":"chevreuse","t":"clorinde","s":"","q":"Clorinde has built quite the reputation for herself in Fontaine as a Champion Duelist. Our positions are different, so I'm not at liberty to make any comments about her work. …"},{"f":"chevreuse","t":"wriothesley","s":"","q":"The work Wriothesley does is highly effective. At least all criminals know that the Fortress of Meropide isn't the type of place you want to stay at long enough to grow old. …"},{"f":"chevreuse","t":"emilie","s":"","q":"Emilie is a good friend. Her expert knowledge of chemistry has been a great help to me many times when analyzing evidence or tracking down a killer. …"},{"f":"navia","t":"clorinde","s":"","q":"She might not say much, or show a lot of emotion, but I can tell that she feels deeply. After my father's death, I... well, it caused quite a rift between us for a long time. …"},{"f":"navia","t":"charlotte","s":"","q":"Charlotte's known for her fast-and-furious reporting, but it's her photography skills that really impress me. …"},{"f":"navia","t":"chiori","s":"","q":"Ah, the fashion designer who brought the coolest Inazuman trends to Fontaine? She's actually been a great help to the Spina behind the scenes. …"},{"f":"navia","t":"furina","s":"","q":"I was lucky enough to catch her in an opera when I was young. Even though it was a charity show, the tickets were nearly impossible to get! …"},{"f":"gaming","t":"xiangling","s":"","q":"Pretty much everything Chef Xiangling cooks is a winner, but my favorite has to be her Black-Back Perch Stew. …"},{"f":"gaming","t":"xingqiu","s":"","q":"The Feiyun Commerce Guild's a longtime client of the Secure Transport Agency. …"},{"f":"gaming","t":"baizhu","s":"","q":"Working as a guard and doing Wushou Dancing means I have a pretty injury-prone lifestyle. Good thing is, Dr. Baizhu's medicine is always there to save the day. …"},{"f":"gaming","t":"xinyan","s":"","q":"Xinyan's music is fire! No pun intended. Man Chai goes crazy for it — always gets him moshing away like a mad gremlin. I'd love to do a joint show together one day. …"},{"f":"xianyun","t":"ganyu","s":"","q":"One once asked Ganyu what she typically works on during her overtime hours. Her response was filled with hideous-sounding words, such as \"meeting minutes,\" \"summaries,\" \"annual reports,\" …"},{"f":"xianyun","t":"shenhe","s":"","q":"Shenhe told me that once, when she was delivering an order for Wanmin Restaurant, she ran across the rooftops to save time. …"},{"f":"xianyun","t":"zhongli","s":"","q":"When Rex Lapis first heard of one's plan to take up residence in Liyue Harbor, he recited a long and detailed list of considerations for the furnishing and adornment of a home. …"},{"f":"xianyun","t":"ningguang","s":"","q":"The Tianquan conducts her business with great adroitness, and is meticulous in her speech. Hmph, one must admit that Liyue is thriving under the governance of the Qixing. …"},{"f":"chiori","t":"navia","s":"","q":"She used to beg me to help her design all kinds of strange things. For example, little crowns for every handle on a ship's helm... …"},{"f":"chiori","t":"lyney","s":"","q":"I can't make a hat that could hide secrets, but it seems Lyney can enchant his hat to do just that... I'm a little curious about how it feels to wear a hat full of so many tricks and secrets like his. …"},{"f":"chiori","t":"lynette","s":"","q":"The magician's assistant sure doesn't say much, but I know she trusts me. You know, I sure get a lot of love from cats..."},{"f":"chiori","t":"charlotte","s":"","q":"One time, Charlotte came into the shop, hoping to do an interview with me. I told her there was no point, because there was nothing new to talk about. …"},{"f":"sigewinne","t":"neuvillette","s":"Respect","q":"Monsieur Neuvillette was the one who brought the Melusines to the Court of Fontaine and found jobs for us to do. …"},{"f":"sigewinne","t":"wriothesley","s":"","q":"The Duke has the highest pain tolerance of anyone I've ever met. …"},{"f":"sigewinne","t":"clorinde","s":"","q":"Miss Clorinde doesn't make a lot of facial expressions when she talks. It's pretty difficult to tell what mood she's in from what her face is doing... She used the lipstick I gave her? Really? …"},{"f":"sigewinne","t":"emilie","s":"","q":"I always see Miss Emilie's perfumes being recommended in beauty magazines. So I've hatched a plan. …"},{"f":"arlecchino","t":"lyney","s":"","q":"Clervie once asked me what a \"real home\" looks like, but I had no answer for her. …"},{"f":"arlecchino","t":"lynette","s":"","q":"Lynette's uniquely calm personality is also her strength, and I believe she is more than clever enough to recognize that. …"},{"f":"arlecchino","t":"freminet","s":"","q":"Freminet has a complex mind and often hides his emotions. He blames himself for things that aren't his doing and allows them to eat away at his conscience. …"},{"f":"arlecchino","t":"furina","s":"","q":"I asked Lyney to deliver an assortment of cakes for her theater troupe to enjoy during teatime. …"},{"f":"sethos","t":"cyno","s":"","q":"Cyno is truly outstanding — absolutely a worthy heir to Hermanubis's power. As General Mahamatra, he has the utmost reverence for knowledge and wisdom. …"},{"f":"sethos","t":"tighnari","s":"","q":"Tighnari's made of strong stuff. I only found out after the fact that he doesn't cope well with the desert climate — never would've guessed from how he performed in the Rite of Duels. …"},{"f":"sethos","t":"wanderer","s":"","q":"Who is that guy, anyway? A foreign exchange student, or something? He has a pretty incredible hat, never seen anything like it. I tried to get a closer look once, but then I blinked and he was gone. …"},{"f":"sethos","t":"dehya","s":"","q":"Flame-Mane... everyone in the desert knows that name. The Eremites aren't exactly saints, as I'm sure you know, but Dehya's one of the few solid and dependable ones out there. …"},{"f":"clorinde","t":"charlotte","s":"","q":"Charlotte is one of the more tactful journalists out there. I don't have anything negative to say about her. …"},{"f":"clorinde","t":"furina","s":"","q":"In the past, I always stood behind her at tea parties, sword at the ready. But now, I get to sit at the table and enjoy the tea and treats along with her. …"},{"f":"clorinde","t":"navia","s":"","q":"Navia's been in a good mood lately. It seems like every other day she's asking me to join her at Tabletop Troupe for a new script. The story is always so different. …"},{"f":"clorinde","t":"neuvillette","s":"","q":"No one is in any doubt as to the Iudex's authority. He always delivers a fair verdict — and when necessary, I will reiterate the fairness of this verdict with my sword."},{"f":"emilie","t":"chevreuse","s":"","q":"I'm not sure if she ever mentioned it, but we met each other through work. Although, most of our conversations aren't nearly as serious as our jobs would suggest. …"},{"f":"emilie","t":"chiori","s":"","q":"As a designer, Chiori has a keen eye for trends. Although we deal in completely different products, I still enjoy listening to her talk about the creative thought process behind her designs. …"},{"f":"emilie","t":"charlotte","s":"","q":"Ah, a truly energetic young lady. Being a journalist, I would imagine quite a few people see her as nothing but trouble, but that hasn't been my experience. …"},{"f":"emilie","t":"clorinde","s":"","q":"I'm fairly certain everyone in Fontaine knows that name. She's a formidable Champion Duelist, after all. Although, I find her quite easy to get along with. …"},{"f":"kachina","t":"mualani","s":"","q":"Mualani's my first good friend! Before I met her, I never even knew that people as sweet as her existed, or how many fun things there are in the world! Look, this is a photo of us! …"},{"f":"kachina","t":"kinich","s":"","q":"It was Mualani who introduced me to him! To be honest, I was a little scared of him at first, because his eyes... well, he's got a scary look. …"},{"f":"kachina","t":"chasca","s":"","q":"She's a famous \"peacemaker\" in Natlan! They say she can resolve any conflict, no sweat. …"},{"f":"kachina","t":"iansan","s":"","q":"Before, when I wanted to become stronger, I asked Iansan to train me. She had me do all sorts of high-intensity workouts, and I often only managed to get through them by pushing myself to the limit. …"},{"f":"kinich","t":"mavuika","s":"","q":"For most of my life, I've been getting others to pay a price. Then, the Pyro Archon used the Ode of Resurrection to bring me back from the Night Kingdom, and suddenly I was the one paying the price... …"},{"f":"kinich","t":"mualani","s":"","q":"I've taken jobs from her before. She offered to pay me to act as a \"battle advisor,\" and the Mora was good, so I accepted. …"},{"f":"kinich","t":"kachina","s":"","q":"I saw a job posting about her once. Some lowlifes from her tribe got jealous that she'd received an ancient name, and basically tried to order a hit on her Saurian companion... …"},{"f":"kinich","t":"chasca","s":"","q":"I've seen how she handles her work. Our methods of conflict-resolution are quite different. I tend to get one party to shut up, but she silences both. …"},{"f":"mualani","t":"mavuika","s":"","q":"The Pyro Archon is the most respected figure in all of Natlan. I really admire her, not only because she's the Pyro Archon, but because... she looks super cool when she surfs! …"},{"f":"mualani","t":"kachina","s":"","q":"Kachina is incredibly gentle and kind. From everything she says, it's clear she's always thinking about others. …"},{"f":"mualani","t":"kinich","s":"","q":"Ajaw will say more in a day than Kinich in a whole year. It can't be easy having to deal with all of Ajaw's antics, but somehow Kinich always manages to do his own thing. …"},{"f":"mualani","t":"chasca","s":"","q":"I met Chasca when I was little. We even fought over toys a few times... I was pretty surprised when I heard she became a Peacemaker. …"},{"f":"xilonen","t":"kachina","s":"","q":"Kachina commissioned me to forge a drill for her that could not only bore into the ground, but also jump around. It wasn't that complicated to make, but adjusting the angle of the seat was tricky. …"},{"f":"xilonen","t":"mualani","s":"","q":"Mualani is an amazing athlete. I've never seen anyone make surfing or gliding on the Spiritways look so smooth or easy. In fact, I have yet to see Mualani ever slip up. Hmm? …"},{"f":"xilonen","t":"chasca","s":"","q":"To get Chasca's gun up and running in high altitude was no easy task. First, I had to make sure it would remain stable and reliable in high speed combat. …"},{"f":"xilonen","t":"mavuika","s":"","q":"Mavuika has approached me with quite a few ridiculous commissions. For example, she wanted me to make her a heat-resistant sword that could withstand her flames and wouldn't melt in her hands. …"},{"f":"chasca","t":"kachina","s":"","q":"\"Every Qucusaur falls from its nest before it learns to fly.\" Kachina didn't magically become a champion overnight. Her victory was a result of consistent, tireless effort over a very long time. …"},{"f":"chasca","t":"mualani","s":"","q":"Mualani says we got into a fight as kids over some toy we both wanted, but I don't remember any of that. Hmm... I wonder if it's because I got into so many fights that I just lost track of them all? …"},{"f":"chasca","t":"xilonen","s":"","q":"She might come across as low-energy, but make no mistake — she's one of the most diligent people you'll ever meet. …"},{"f":"chasca","t":"mavuika","s":"","q":"Some people compare me to the Pyro Archon because of my track record in the Pilgrimage. It's a meaningless comparison. …"},{"f":"ororon","t":"xilonen","s":"","q":"She seems to enjoy relaxing in high places, especially trees. In my experience, hanging upside down from a tree branch is more relaxing than lying on top of one. …"},{"f":"ororon","t":"ifa","s":"","q":"Ifa may scold his patients a lot, but he actually has a great relationship with the saurians. …"},{"f":"ororon","t":"citlali","s":"","q":"Granny is actually a very straightforward person. She wears her emotions on her sleeve, you know? It's hard for her to hide what she's feeling. You're the same age as her, right? Or... …"},{"f":"ororon","t":"mavuika","s":"","q":"I didn't really know the Pyro Archon before all this. I mean, I knew of her, but I didn't KNOW know her, you know? I used to think of her like a totem engraved with the word \"strength,\" …"},{"f":"mavuika","t":"xilonen","s":"","q":"Xilonen is one of the best craftsmen in Natlan. She has the ability to forge Ancient Names and is well-versed in Secret Source technology. …"},{"f":"mavuika","t":"citlali","s":"","q":"Many people find her strange or difficult to get along with. But, this is how I see it — Citlali doesn't concern herself with trivial matters, but she's always there when it counts. …"},{"f":"mavuika","t":"chasca","s":"","q":"Being able to survive under the influence of Abyssal corrosion was already a miracle, but thanks to the people and Saurians of this land, she even found a reason not just to survive, but to live. …"},{"f":"mavuika","t":"ororon","s":"","q":"In my opinion, Ororon's true personality is very different from what he projects on the outside — like lava covered in ice. …"},{"f":"citlali","t":"ororon","s":"","q":"Hmph."},{"f":"citlali","t":"mualani","s":"","q":"Between me and Mualani, I honestly don't know who owes who anymore. She breaks my door, owes me Mora, steals my food, but then she brings me snacks and pays for other things... …"},{"f":"citlali","t":"xilonen","s":"","q":"She's someone who completely ignores the rumors about me and doesn't go overboard with friendliness. So, I always feel comfortable around her. Oh! Not that I feel uncomfortable around you! I'm just... …"},{"f":"citlali","t":"mavuika","s":"","q":"Heh, Mavuika... *ahem* I mean, the Archon came to talk to me the other day. It wasn't until I was eating snacks in the middle of the night that I realized she was basically bragging the whole time! …"},{"f":"lan_yan","t":"xiangling","s":"","q":"Everyone says first impressions are important, and the first time I ate at Wanmin Restaurant, I had so much regret... regret that it took me so long to visit Liyue Harbor! …"},{"f":"lan_yan","t":"hu_tao","s":"","q":"Director Hu always seems so upbeat and cheerful. Even when the situation was desperate, she was always there with a joke to cheer me up. I haven't known her long, so I was wondering... …"},{"f":"lan_yan","t":"keqing","s":"","q":"When will the Yuheng finally take a break? She was running all over the place during the Lantern Rite. I wanted to treat her to a meal to thank her for her kindness, but I never had the chance... …"},{"f":"lan_yan","t":"gaming","s":"","q":"I've known Gaming since we were kids! He was quite the neighborhood terror back then, haha. Hm? That doesn't sound like him? Well, he's matured a lot since then, just like I have. …"},{"f":"yumemizuki_mizuki","t":"yae_miko","s":"Past History","q":"Hundreds of years ago, we were neighbors. Miko was a lot more serious about her pursuits back then, but still, the innocence of youth permeated everything. …"},{"f":"yumemizuki_mizuki","t":"raiden_shogun","s":"","q":"I worked up the courage to invite the Almighty Shogun to the bathhouse after the Mikawa Flower Festival. As she settled into the pool, a strand of her hair drifted into the water. …"},{"f":"yumemizuki_mizuki","t":"sangonomiya_kokomi","s":"","q":"The Divine Priestess of Watatsumi Island is a dignified and well-mannered lady. Speaking with her always lifts my spirits. …"},{"f":"yumemizuki_mizuki","t":"sayu","s":"","q":"Hehe, she's quite the carefree little mujina, her only trouble, of course, being the desire to grow taller... I'm sure her dreams are exceedingly sweet. …"},{"f":"iansan","t":"citlali","s":"","q":"I have a lot of respect for Granny Itztli, but... I can't say I agree with her lifestyle choices. …"},{"f":"iansan","t":"mualani","s":"","q":"Mualani has always impressed me. She's never taken any formal fitness training, and yet her strength and physique are better than most of the students I've had. …"},{"f":"iansan","t":"xilonen","s":"","q":"Xilonen is the first friend I ever made from the Children of Echoes. …"},{"f":"iansan","t":"mavuika","s":"","q":"Because of the childhood I had, I don't like relying on other people or needing their protection. But when Mavuika is around, even I feel comfortable letting her take the lead. …"},{"f":"varesa","t":"iansan","s":"Coach and Commander","q":"Iansan is my coach. I look up to her the most out of anyone! She helped me discover my true strength, taught me how to fight, and even got me a job in our tribe's Patrol Team. …"},{"f":"varesa","t":"mavuika","s":"","q":"I heard that the plates Mavuika uses on her barbell lifts are five times the weight of her flamestrider! And that she uses ten plates minimum just as a warmup... …"},{"f":"varesa","t":"mualani","s":"","q":"There was this time when Coach Iansan noticed I'd overshot my target weight, and decided I needed a cutting phase. …"},{"f":"varesa","t":"kinich","s":"","q":"I haven't entered the Pilgrimage that many times, but once, I came up against Kinich during the group stage. That guy is so nimble... …"},{"f":"escoffier","t":"furina","s":"First Meeting","q":"Early in my career, I worked at a small restaurant in the Vasari Passage. One day, entirely out of the blue, Lady Furina decided to dine at our restaurant after a performance. …"},{"f":"escoffier","t":"navia","s":"","q":"My parents took me to the Hotel Debord for the first time on my fifth birthday. I remember — I found this hat on the ground. It was beautiful and carried the intense, warm aroma of roses. …"},{"f":"escoffier","t":"charlotte","s":"","q":"As a professional reporter with impeccable writing skills, Charlotte has a lot of clout in the culinary world. Her flavor descriptions are so detailed and her photography skills are unmatched. …"},{"f":"escoffier","t":"sigewinne","s":"","q":"The Head Nurse, huh... Well, um... She's a lovely person, of course. It's just... her sense of taste is, in a word, unique.... Which I completely understand and respect. …"},{"f":"ifa","t":"kachina","s":"","q":"I can tell that Kachina has a real soft spot for saurians. If she put in the work, I'm sure she'd make an excellent vet. …"},{"f":"ifa","t":"xilonen","s":"","q":"I love chatting with Xilonen. She's always brimming with all sorts of fantastic creative ideas. Sometimes, her insistence on raw functionality can result in contraptions that look a little... …"},{"f":"ifa","t":"kinich","s":"","q":"Serious question: Does Ajaw technically count as a living being? When he came to see me for treatment, I gave him a very thorough checkup but couldn't find anything wrong with him. …"},{"f":"ifa","t":"chasca","s":"","q":"Her work as a peacemaker is extremely important. She cures a lot of ills that are beyond my reach."},{"f":"skirk","t":"tartaglia","s":"","q":"He's improved — next time we spar, I might even use both hands. Ajax has a lot of talent and he is fearless in battle, which gives him the potential to develop great strength. …"},{"f":"skirk","t":"dori","s":"","q":"Ah, yeah, the shrewd merchant. She's one of Alice's friends. I occasionally sell rare monster carcasses to her, since I need Mora to get by in Teyvat. …"},{"f":"skirk","t":"neuvillette","s":"","q":"Lost power is always reclaimed in the end, in some shape or form. But where will this power lead? To a trial? To revenge? Or toward a new future? …"},{"f":"skirk","t":"nicole","s":"","q":"I wonder if becoming human was an evolution or regression to her? How did it feel, witnessing the self-destruction of her species firsthand? …"},{"f":"dahlia","t":"venti","s":"","q":"Venti is a dear friend. Whenever I'm seeking to know the will of the Anemo Archon, he's always more than happy to clear things up for me. …"},{"f":"dahlia","t":"barbara","s":"","q":"Barbara is a fellow member of the clergy and also a friend. She's always there to support me when I need help. In return, I always make sure to look out for ways she can help me. …"},{"f":"dahlia","t":"rosaria","s":"","q":"Rosaria and I are very close friends, so I'm used to her habitual absences from church. But she was extremely closed-off back when we first met. Wouldn't open up to me about her secrets. …"},{"f":"dahlia","t":"kaeya","s":"","q":"Kaeya is my top drinking buddy. Sometimes, I need to negotiate a one-month all-you-can-drink deal at the tavern for Venti, and I couldn't do it without Kaeya's haggling skills. …"},{"f":"ineffa","t":"aino","s":"Housework","q":"Aino is my family. She can piece together all kinds of machines for various functions just from the scrap metal she collects. But her proficiency with other tasks is at the opposite end of the scale. …"},{"f":"ineffa","t":"jahoda","s":"","q":"Jahoda is a legendary bounty hunter famed throughout the land, with an outstanding track record in battle. Her own words. …"},{"f":"ineffa","t":"lauma","s":"","q":"Lauma is the Moonchanter of the Frostmoon Scions. Reviews by her people indicate that she is a wise and holy figure, well-respected in the community. The Frostmoon Scions worship the moon goddess... …"},{"f":"ineffa","t":"linnea","s":"","q":"Linnea is an advisor to the Adventurers' Guild. I heard that she has extensive knowledge in the life sciences, so I wanted to ask her if she has ever met any other autonomous mechanical lifeforms…"},{"f":"lauma","t":"ineffa","s":"","q":"It's not unusual to come across prosthetically augmented people in Nod-Krai, but a wholly mechanical person from the inside out is quite a different story... …"},{"f":"lauma","t":"aino","s":"","q":"She is a very precocious child, but fate has not given her an easy ride. Her inventions have helped many people — Nod-Krai should feel honored to count her as one of their own. …"},{"f":"lauma","t":"flins","s":"","q":"He comes across as very polite and courteous, but for some reason the animals seem to fear him... …"},{"f":"lauma","t":"nefer","s":"","q":"Clearly, we are different people with different ways of doing things, but I have never taken that to mean that we cannot get along. …"},{"f":"flins","t":"lauma","s":"","q":"Hyperborea, the bygone golden elysium... That is what comes to mind whenever I see her. …"},{"f":"flins","t":"illuga","s":"","q":"Members of the Lightkeepers are under no obligation to stay — and many do, in fact, leave shortly after joining. Only the most determined persevere, and Illuga is one such example. …"},{"f":"flins","t":"aino","s":"","q":"I must confess that I do not deal well with machines. This, and not the age difference, is the biggest point of disparity between myself and Aino."},{"f":"flins","t":"varka","s":"","q":"You shan't catch me crossing blades with Varka, there's simply no contest. No sword in the world has a sharper bite than the North Wind. …"},{"f":"aino","t":"ineffa","s":"Warmth","q":"I've made a bunch of upgrades to Ineffa since she first woke up. …"},{"f":"aino","t":"jahoda","s":"","q":"Jahoda might bicker a lot with Ineffa, but they're actually really close. She was the first friend that Ineffa made. …"},{"f":"aino","t":"lauma","s":"","q":"You like her antlers? I could make you a pair just like them. Oh, and how about I make them glow and grow flowers? Or maybe shoot fireworks? It'd be a piece of cake for me. …"},{"f":"aino","t":"flins","s":"","q":"Ah, what a fine young gentleman he is. His speech is music to my ears, like the beautiful clink-clank of moving machinery. ...Too far? Well, yeah, it's pretty high praise, I guess... …"},{"f":"nefer","t":"lauma","s":"","q":"Our pure and merciful Lady Moonchanter... So kind, so gentle, and full of compassion for all. It's no wonder that people are drawn to her. …"},{"f":"nefer","t":"flins","s":"","q":"It is often said that politeness is the most effective means of keeping strangers at bay. I guess that makes Mr. Flins a master of the art of social distancing. …"},{"f":"nefer","t":"jahoda","s":"","q":"Jahoda is the most capable — and frankly, the most valuable — of the Curatorium's employees. Without her, the whole place would surely grind to a halt. …"},{"f":"nefer","t":"aino","s":"","q":"The robotic arm she made for Jahoda works surprisingly well, though it certainly didn't come cheap. Relax — I covered the manufacture and maintenance costs up front. …"},{"f":"durin","t":"albedo","s":"Family","q":"Albedo has shared so many of his experiences with me regarding becoming truly human. He's explained many of the problems that humans face — things like work, ideals, life... …"},{"f":"durin","t":"wanderer","s":"Friends","q":"Shortly after leaving Simulanka, I followed Hat Guy to Sumeru. The Akademiya was so big and so beautiful — and there were so many books. …"},{"f":"durin","t":"venti","s":"","q":"\"The young bard gently plucked his strings, a voice as clear as a mountain stream. It was no battle hymn nor prayer, but the murmuring of stars, the wind blowing through the trees. …"},{"f":"durin","t":"klee","s":"","q":"Albedo once told me he treats Klee like a little sister. Klee likes to call me Big Brother Durin, too. …"},{"f":"jahoda","t":"lauma","s":"","q":"Miss Lauma? Uhm... I don't really know too much about her, but I know she's kind of a big deal, and she's powerful... and she can talk to animals... …"},{"f":"jahoda","t":"ineffa","s":"","q":"Oh, that dumb clanker? She's good at baking krumkakes, but she's got a memory like a leaky sieve and zero humor. Every time I crack a joke she asks me to explain why it's funny. …"},{"f":"jahoda","t":"nefer","s":"","q":"Nef's the best boss in the whole world! Hehe, not only does she pay me on time, she even covers food and board! I might be her only actual employee... No, wait, I almost forgot about Ashru! …"},{"f":"jahoda","t":"aino","s":"","q":"Aino's got some serious skills. No matter what I put my arm through, she always gets it working again. It's just... every time she fixes it, she always doodles on it. Says it's cuter that way. …"},{"f":"columbina","t":"lauma","s":"","q":"Aiming a beam of moonlight at Lauma's head makes her antlers grow taller, and if you get the angle just right, you can even get them to stab a piece of fruit that's too high to reach... Hmm? …"},{"f":"columbina","t":"arlecchino","s":"","q":"The House of the Hearth is home to many children, and it can get quite noisy. The first time I heard them call Arlecchino \"Father,\" I thought it was a rule that had to be followed there. …"},{"f":"columbina","t":"tartaglia","s":"","q":"I've heard he has a good relationship with his family. They go camping together and have barbecues by the lake. Sandrone says he's the Harbinger who lives most like an ordinary person. …"},{"f":"columbina","t":"nicole","s":"","q":"Oh, we kept in touch until a short while ago. I asked her to recommend some books for me to read to the kuuhenki. …"},{"f":"zibai","t":"zhongli","s":"","q":"Though mortals call me the White Horse Adeptus, I was not bestowed with this title by Morax, the Prime of Adepti. …"},{"f":"zibai","t":"ningguang","s":"","q":"I understand that the Liyue of today is built on trade and commerce — a highly involved and complex affair. …"},{"f":"zibai","t":"xianyun","s":"","q":"I have met with Cloud Retainer — or \"Xianyun,\" as she has taken to calling herself. …"},{"f":"zibai","t":"keqing","s":"","q":"I ran into the Yuheng once on the outskirts of Liyue. She was there with a team from the Ministry of Civil Affairs to conduct some land measurements. …"},{"f":"illuga","t":"flins","s":"Drop-Ins","q":"When I first met Mr. Flins, I assumed that the reason he lived alone was either because he didn't like being around people, or that he was just a little... eccentric. …"},{"f":"illuga","t":"linnea","s":"","q":"Even in a place as diverse as Nod-Krai, Fae ladies like Miss Linnea are few and far between. I originally figured she'd be the quiet, graceful type, but it turns out that was WAY off. …"},{"f":"illuga","t":"lauma","s":"","q":"Our friendship with the Frostmoon Scions goes all the way back to the days of the Torchforger himself. …"},{"f":"illuga","t":"varka","s":"","q":"I've fought side-by-side with Mr. Varka against the Wild Hunt, and I can tell you this — his fighting skills are up there with the best of them. …"},{"f":"varka","t":"razor","s":"","q":"Back when I first met Razor, he was only a few inches taller than the wolf pups of Wolvendom. Heh, he could barely lift a greatsword! …"},{"f":"varka","t":"rosaria","s":"","q":"Uh... I'll keep my lips sealed where she's concerned. Don't wanna get scolded for being a blabbermouth. There's ice in that glare of hers... …"},{"f":"varka","t":"diluc","s":"","q":"So, he still won't return to the Knights? Haha, fair enough — the wind in Mondstadt has always been free to come and go as it pleases. …"},{"f":"varka","t":"kaeya","s":"","q":"I know how much Master Crepus meant to Kaeya. That tragic incident was no less devastating for him than for his adoptive brother. But even after enduring such injustice and fraternal strife... …"},{"f":"lohen","t":"varka","s":"Resistance to Medicine","q":"Varka's resistance to medicine keeps growing by the day. I mixed him a draught a few days ago that barely flushed his cheeks. …"},{"f":"lohen","t":"kaeya","s":"","q":"Kaeya has a real knack for imitating the other Captains' signatures, not to mention Jean's. In fact, his forgeries are so good, it's practically impossible to spot the difference. …"},{"f":"lohen","t":"klee","s":"","q":"Varka told me he thinks that Fatui Harbinger, The Captain, could have taken out a Ruin Guard with just a crayon. …"},{"f":"lohen","t":"mika","s":"","q":"Mika might be a skilled cartographer, but I'm even more skilled when it comes to sniffing out a lie. …"},{"f":"linnea","t":"aino","s":"","q":"Oh, we were in the Conch Gang together, you know. Aino was such a cutie when she was little. Then at some point, she became all about her machines... …"},{"f":"linnea","t":"ineffa","s":"","q":"I hear she makes the sweetest, most delicious krumkakes around. Sadly, I've never had a chance to try one, because I instinctively run away the moment she shows up... …"},{"f":"linnea","t":"illuga","s":"","q":"He's pretty young for a squad leader in the Lightkeepers. Must be a pretty talented guy. Unfortunately, we met under slightly chaotic circumstances, so I probably didn't make a great impression... …"},{"f":"linnea","t":"lauma","s":"","q":"Her antlers are so pretty... Once, I very politely asked her if I could touch them. She, uh, very politely refused. Turns out the Frostmoon Scions are even stricter than the Melusines..."},{"f":"nicole","t":"klee","s":"","q":"Klee is adorable. But Alice is worried I might have a bad influence on her brain development, so she doesn't let me speak in her head. Do you think that makes me seem weird to Klee? …"},{"f":"nicole","t":"albedo","s":"","q":"In another converged possibility, Albedo was the \"Primordial Human\" who traveled through worlds, recording and creating all. …"},{"f":"nicole","t":"mona","s":"","q":"So, for some strange reason, Mona and Barbie are still refusing to meet face to face, and their only contact is through letters? Well, I suppose it's understandable. …"},{"f":"nicole","t":"prune","s":"","q":"Alice said she sent that little Witch Hunter on her quest \"because it makes life more entertaining.\" …"},{"f":"prune","t":"klee","s":"","q":"I'll admit, at first I only approached her to get information. After all, as Alice's daughter, she must know a lot of her secrets, right? I... just didn't expect her to be so... open and trusting. …"},{"f":"prune","t":"sayu","s":"","q":"At her age, \"sleeping where you can when you can\" isn't a bad move. Just look at all those adults drowning in work or anxieties. …"},{"f":"prune","t":"yaoyao","s":"","q":"Yaoyao's really good with her hands. She's helped me tie my hair ribbon quite a few times now. She always does such a good job — way better than I could. …"},{"f":"prune","t":"qiqi","s":"","q":"Oh, I bought her a bunch of Dango Milk, 'cause she said she liked it so much at the little witches' tea party. Hm? I—I bought way too much for one person? Well, it was buy-one-get-one-free. …"}],"bonds":{"diluc|kaeya":"Sworn brothers raised in the same house. They fought the night Diluc's father died, when Kaeya confessed where he came from, and have kept a wary peace since.","barbara|jean":"Sisters separated by their parents' divorce. Each admires the other and neither quite knows how to say so.","diluc|jean":"Former comrades in the Knights. Jean still trusts him, and he still helps, as long as nobody calls it helping the Knights.","jean|varka":"Grand Master and the deputy he left in charge. She has run the order for years in his name.","venti|zhongli":"The two oldest of the Seven. One brings wine, the other disapproves and drinks it anyway.","venti|xiao":"Long ago the sound of Venti's flute pulled Xiao back from the edge of his karmic debt.","xiao|zhongli":"Morax freed the yaksha from a cruel master and gave him his name. Xiao has served him ever since.","hu_tao|zhongli":"Employer and consultant. She is the only person in Liyue who orders the Geo Archon around.","tartaglia|zhongli":"Childe paid Zhongli's bills while being used in the Archon's final contract. He took the deception surprisingly well.","ganyu|zhongli":"She has kept the contract she signed with Rex Lapis for three thousand years.","zhongli|zibai":"The White Horse Adeptus fought beside Rex Lapis in the Archon War, before the histories lost her.","beidou|ningguang":"The Tianquan and the pirate she pretends not to fund. They play chess and trade favours.","keqing|ningguang":"Fellow Qixing who rarely agree and work well together because of it.","ganyu|xianyun":"Cloud Retainer helped raise Ganyu, and will tell anyone the embarrassing stories.","shenhe|xianyun":"Master and disciple. Cloud Retainer took in the abandoned child and taught her the adepti arts.","chongyun|xingqiu":"Best friends. Xingqiu's hobby is finding new ways to trick Chongyun into eating spicy food.","baizhu|qiqi":"He took her in at Bubu Pharmacy. She suspects he wants the secret of her immortality, and stays anyway.","hu_tao|qiqi":"Hu Tao wants to give Qiqi a proper burial. Qiqi wants Hu Tao to go away.","albedo|klee":"Alice left Klee in Albedo's care. He treats her as a little sister.","albedo|sucrose":"Mentor and assistant in the alchemy lab.","albedo|durin":"Both are creations of Rhinedottir. Albedo studied the first Durin's remains on Dragonspine, and now has a living brother.","amber|eula":"Amber was the first in Mondstadt to befriend the Lawrence heir without caring about her name.","amber|collei":"Amber befriended Collei when she was brought to Mondstadt, and taught her to trust again.","lisa|razor":"She taught the wolf boy to use Electro, and a few human words.","raiden_shogun|yae_miko":"Friends for centuries. Yae kept watch while Ei hid from the world, and found the Traveler to wake her.","kujou_sara|raiden_shogun":"The general whose devotion to the Shogun is absolute.","raiden_shogun|wanderer":"He was her first puppet body, set aside when he wept. She let him live, and he never forgave being left.","kamisato_ayaka|kamisato_ayato":"Siblings who run the Yashiro Commission together. He takes the dirty work so she can stay in the light.","kamisato_ayaka|thoma":"He came to the Kamisato estate as a boy and became the family's most trusted friend.","arataki_itto|kuki_shinobu":"Boss and deputy. She gets him out of jail with paperwork.","arataki_itto|kujou_sara":"She confiscated his Vision. He has demanded a rematch ever since.","gorou|sangonomiya_kokomi":"Priestess and her general. He would follow her plan into any battle.","beidou|kaedehara_kazuha":"She took the fugitive samurai aboard the Crux without asking what he had done.","nahida|wanderer":"She saw through his memories, spared him, and gave him work and a place in Sumeru.","alhaitham|nahida":"He led the plan that freed her. She values him for telling her the truth.","alhaitham|kaveh":"Housemates and old research partners who cannot agree on anything.","cyno|tighnari":"Close friends. Tighnari is one of the few who tells Cyno his jokes are bad.","collei|tighnari":"He is her teacher in the Forest Rangers and her doctor.","cyno|sethos":"The same priestly spirit was planted in both as children. Sethos gave his half to Cyno.","candace|dehya":"Two desert-born fighters who trust each other without many words.","lynette|lyney":"Twins who survived the streets together and will not be separated.","arlecchino|lyney":"She raised him in the House of the Hearth and named him her successor.","furina|neuvillette":"For five hundred years he judged beside her without knowing what she carried alone.","neuvillette|wriothesley":"Chief Justice and Duke, who share tea, information and a duty to the same sea.","clorinde|navia":"Friends since childhood, divided by the duel that killed Navia's father and reunited by the truth.","sigewinne|wriothesley":"The Duke and the nurse who has patched him up since he was a prisoner.","kinich|mualani":"Friends across tribes. She talks, he listens.","citlali|mavuika":"The Archon and the shaman who watched her plan unfold over centuries, between novels.","citlali|ororon":"She raised him, and scolds him to hide how much she worries.","kachina|xilonen":"Xilonen forged Kachina's Ancient Name and looks out for her.","skirk|tartaglia":"Master and pupil. She taught a lost boy to survive the Abyss in three months.","columbina|lauma":"The Moonchanter's faith is given to the very Moon Maiden she comes to know as a person.","aino|ineffa":"Inventor and invention, and each other's family.","flins|illuga":"Fellow Lightkeepers. The young squad leader never knows when Flins will drop in.","jahoda|nefer":"Boss and employee at the Curatorium of Secrets.","columbina|sandrone":"Fellow Harbingers. The Moon Maiden finds the Marionette's clockwork nature endlessly interesting.","arlecchino|columbina":"Harbingers who share a rare mutual respect.","razor|varka":"Varka found the wolf boy, named him and gave him his first sword.","lohen|varka":"The Grand Master and one of his expedition's frontline officers.","klee|nicole":"Klee's mother Alice counts Nicole among her sisters of the Hexenzirkel.","mona|nicole":"Mona's master Barbeloth is one of Nicole's fellow witches.","klee|prune":"The Witch Hunter's quarry is Klee's mother, which makes this friendship complicated."},"elements":["Pyro","Hydro","Anemo","Electro","Dendro","Cryo","Geo"],"regions":["Mondstadt","Liyue","Inazuma","Sumeru","Fontaine","Natlan","Nod-Krai","Snezhnaya","Beyond"],"labels":{"extra":"Constellation","title":"Title","faction":"Affiliation","region":"Nation","weapon":"Weapon","el":"Vision"}};
